<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">ACT - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">ACT - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">ACT - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">ACT - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">ACT - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Iban Yeso Hi ri Shuwulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Ri mbe won ri kɨmo, a wu Tiyofalas, me ngan ritu bibi wawu kya riwa Yeso a gbuchi ran ti nga ran tsro <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />Ye ri chachu riwa wa ban wu hi shuwulu, kugon riwa a ti Wu Tsitsri ndu hi ri wandu wan riwa a chu wa nowa hi fen wa ton. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Kugon riwa a so ya ran kuu, ka ngɨzhi ngawan hi ri nji ran la wa bibi kya riwa no wa to ri wawu he si. A zhuu ri wa ndu wan han ivi senza ran tre ritu Kpanchison Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ri vi ro ri, riwa a ran ri ri ri wa, ka nowa ri: &lt;&lt; Ran ka Urushelima don ran, ama bi ki gben Yuu Tsitsri riwa Iti won Izhi tre wawu ri no yi riwa bi wo me la yi ritu wan. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohana a son yi tu ri ima, ama ri vi kusi wa son yi tu ri Wu Tsitsri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Riwa wandu wan wa Kabru, wa mɨyen wu, &lt;&lt;Bachi, wu ye riwa wu no Israila Kpanchison mba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yeso ka tre ri wa: &lt;&lt;A ran he riwa bi to vi ko chachu riwa A ti won ka zi ri gbengbren wan ran. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ama bi fe gbengbren Ka Iyu tsitsri a ye ri yi; nga bi he wa showen gon ri gbu Urushelima nga ri wawu gbu Yahudiya nga Samariya nga ri kɨrememe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Kugon riwa a tre tre-a, wa ban wu hi shu ri si mba, nga Ikpa wulu Ka ka wu ri kusi mba.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Wa zhu si ran ya shuwulu riwa a ran hi ngawan, riwa ri bubu wan nji hari wa suu tsro kinklan wari kri kusan mba. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />&lt;&lt;Wa nji Galili,&gt;&gt; Wa tre, &lt;&lt;Ngye ti bi kukɨri riwa ri ya shu? Wawu Yeso, riwa bi to wa ban wu hi shu, ari bru ye bibi riwa bi to wa ban wu ri hi shuwulu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Chu Matiyas yo ri Nyu Yauza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Imba wa wandu wan wa bru hi ri Urushelima zhu ri ngblu riwa wa yo ri Ngblu Zaitun, a ran bran nkon zhu ri gbu ran. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Riwa wa zhu ri gbu, waka hi tra ri shu rimi tra riwa wa ki. Wawa wa he ri bubu wan wa he Andarawus; Filibu nga Toma, Batalomi nga Matiyu; Yakubu ivren Halfa nga Saminu Zaloti, nga Yauza ivren Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Wa kabru wawu mba wari ran bre Izhi, nga wa mba nga Meremu Iyi Yeso, nga miri vayi wan.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Ri vi wa sen Bitrus a wulunde rimi mba wawa wa kpa Izhi (riwa a he gbigba ri ri se hari) <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />ran tre, &lt;&lt;Miri vayi, mbe-a no he riwa Iyu Tsitsri a tre ri sen hu ri nyu Doda ritu Yauza, riwa a yo gba ri wawa wa vu Yeso <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yauza a he ri rimi mbu nga ran ti ndu rita bubu ndu-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Ri fe rimi meme ti wan, Yauza a rebubu meme; Imba ka joku ran yɨra nne iren wan waka zhu rega. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Ko ngan ri Urushelima a wo kya riwa a ti Yauza, Waka yo nde rɨma-a ri rɨme mba ri Akaldama, wato, irɨma ri Yii)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Bitrus ka tre,&lt;&lt;A he rimi ngan ri mbe Zabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;&lt;&lt;No ko wan no he huo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">No njo no ran son rimi wan ran,&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Ngha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;&lt;&lt; No njo nkan no ban kpanchison wan.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ritu ngamba a he riwa ki chu nji ri riwa a he rimi mbu ri wawu vi riwa Yeso a hi rimi ran zhu rimi mbu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />&lt;&lt;Ritu ngamba ki su no njo no hu ta rimi ndu nyi riwa a to kya riwa a hi hari hi ri vi tashɨme Bachi Yeso. Ari he iri rimi nji wawa wa he ri bubu riwa wawu kyawa wa ti riwa Yeso a ran zren rita, gbuchi ri vi riwa Yohana a ran tsro tre wan ri sonjitu ri ima tse chachu riwa wa ban Yeso rita hi ri shuwulu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Wa ngji nji hari ye: Yusufu riwa wa yo wu ri Basaba nga wana yo ri Yustus ngawen, nga Matiyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Imiri ndu wan waka bre Izhi ri,&lt;&lt;Bachi, wu to tika ko ngan, a he ngamba tsro ta nji riwa wu chu rimi hari wanyi <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />no he ivren ri ndu ri nyun Yahuda, riwa a hi ngawan ri bubu riwa a zhu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Imba Waka tangbe yo ritu nji hari-a, ŋgbe ka ku ritu Matyasi, riwa a he rɨ rimi wuru don hari rimi mirindu wuru donri.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Iye Iyu Tsitsri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Riwa ivi ro ri pentekos, (ivi seton kugon ro ri pentekos) a ye, wawu wa hu Izhi wa kuki ri bubu rɨ. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ri bubu wan waka wo ran a zhu ri shuwulu ye riwa a glo ka gungu ri senkpa. Ko ngan rimi ko riwa wa kuki-a a wo glo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Wa to kya ri a he ka lɨwen wulu riwa a ga ti hari, nga ran ka ku ritu ko ngan rimi mba wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wawu mba wa sho ri Wu Tsitsri, nga waka gbuchi ran tre ri liwen nkan nkan bibi riwa Iyu a no wa ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Nji Yahuda wari wawa wa ran hu Izhi wa he ko kutan ri gbungblume riwa wana son ri Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Riwa wa wo kpagro-a, ikpa nji wa kabru ri bubu ri. Wawu mba waka ran ti kinklan sron, ritu ko ngan a wo wana ran tre ri rɨme mba. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Waka ti kyawa wari ran ti mamaki wana tre ri ngamba ri, &lt;&lt;Wawu mba wana he wa nji Galili ran? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ko a he se, ko, riwa wawu mbu ki wo wa tre ri rɨme mbu? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Ga kita wa nji Fatiya ri wa nji Madiyana ri nji Elama ri nji meme gbu Mesopotamiya riwa Yahudiya, riwa Kafadokiya, ri Fantas, nga riwa Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Wari wa zhu ri Farijiya, nga ri Famfiliya, nga ri Masar, nga riwa wa kagon gbu Libiya, hi ri nyu gran gbu Roma, wato nji Yahuda, nga gran wawa wa gra ri Roma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />nga ri karitawa, ri larabawa; doka ki wo wa tre ritu kpolo kyawa riwa Izhi ti ri rɨme mba.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wawu mba wa ka ti mamaki, wari ti sisiri wa ri ran tre ngamba, ri &lt;&lt;Ngye ngayin?&lt;&lt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ama wari rimi mba wa ka tachon wa ri tre.&lt;&lt;Wa so hi wa ri wua!&lt;&lt; Bitrus a tre ri chachu ro ri pentecos.&lt;&lt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tre Bitrus Chachu pentecos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Imba Bitrus a wulunde ri ngbron mirindu wurudon ri ran tre gbangban ri kpanji, ran tre, &lt;&lt;Biyi mirivayi won nji Yahuda nga wawu wawa wa ki rimi Urushelima, bi mɨlan rinyi ya, nga bi ri wo tre won. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Nji wanyi wana so hi ran, bibi riwa bi yo sron; <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Rinyi nye a he kya riwa Izhi a tre hu nyu Yowel nji ri la tre Izhi:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />&lt;&lt; Izhi a tre, ri vi ri kre, me bwa Wu won ri ko ngan wa nji mbi wa dɨbu dindi tre won. Ngha mirinze mbi wa to kusi nga chanchon nji mbi wa rara.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ko ri mirindu won, ri ronron ri mba, me bwa Wu won ri vi wan, nga wa la nyu Jii. <verse eid="ACT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Me ti kya ri de sisri ri shu-shuwulu nga kya wa wulu siron ri ngbungbɨlu meme, iyi nga wulu nga ntsenkpawulu. <verse eid="ACT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />iji ri kɨma ti bu nga iwua ri kɨma ti yi ko ivi ri gra nga vi ri nkpen riwa Bachi no ye. <verse eid="ACT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ama ko ngan riwa a yo nde Bachi ari nawo.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Wo tre nyi: Miri vayi mbu wa Israila, Yeso ri Nazareae nji riwa senkpa Izhi a tsro nde riyi ri kyawa wa sisiri nga kya wa nzu sron riwa Izhi a ti riwu, biyi kyumbi bi to rinyi, ritu a ti rimi mbi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Nji nyi wa ka de ri mɨlanto ya wa Jii, bi kpanwu ri konkron ri wo nji riwa wana to Jii ran. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ama nji a no tashɨme, ran kpa chuwo rimi gbengbren kuu, ritu a ran he riwa ikuu riya ngɨzhi wu ri gbengbren wan ran. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Doda a tre ritu wan,&lt;&lt;&lt;Me to Bachi bla vi ritu kusi won ritu a he kuwo ri won ritu me ran ti sisiri ran. <verse eid="ACT 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ritu ngamba isiron won a ngɨri nga liwen won ngawen a ran ngɨri; ikpa won ngawen ri son ri yo sron, <verse eid="ACT 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ritu wu ran ka sron won ri bubu wa kuu ran, ko wuri no wa tsitsri wen nowa gla ri bubu gyuru ran. <verse eid="ACT 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Wu no wen me to tu sron; wu ye rɨme wuri no wen kinklan sron.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Miri vayi, me la yi ri senkpa ritu ititimbu Doda, riwa a kuu waka ban wu no yɨwi, nga bubu gyuru wan he ri ta ye luwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ama a he wa ndu Jii, nga a to ri Iji a la nyu ri wu: Iji a shiji ran tre wu ri wawu ri chu nji ri rimi gran wa Doda no he Chu, bibi wa Doda. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Riwa Doda a to ikya riwa Iji ri ti ri kusi, imba ran tre ritu tashɨme Bachi ri bubu gyuru riwa a tre: &lt;Wa ran kau don ri bubu wa kuu ran; ikpa wan ran gla ri bubu gyuru ran. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Iji a ta Yeso shɨme ri kuu, kita wawu mbu ki he sheda wan. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yeso a son kuwo ri riwa Jii, Iti wan, nga ran kpa Iyu Tsitsri riwu, bibi riwa a la nyu riwu. Ikya riwa bi to bi ri wo zizan a he ide wan riwa a ka bwa sro ri ta. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Aran he Doda nye a hon ri shuwulu ran; tsede a tre: Kuson ri kuwo ri won <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />tse me no kpan fu wen no wa he kpanchi ri sro za wen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Wawu mbi nji Israila, a he riwa bi to ri Yeso nyi, riwa wa kpan wu ri tu konkron-a, wawu nye he Bachi, nga Kristo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Riwa nji wa wo rinyi, wa yi ri sron mba wa ri tre ri Bitrus nga ngbɨron mirindu Jii, &lt;&lt; Imiri vayi ngye ki ti?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Bitrus ka la wa&lt;&lt;Ko ngan rimi mbi no ka meme ti chuwo wari son yi tu ri ima rimi nde Yeso Kristo, bibi riwa wa ka meme ti mbi chuwo ri yi; nga bi kpa Ide riwa Jii, Iyu Tsitsri. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ritu ila nyu Jii a he ri yi ri wa miri mbi, nga wawa wa he kpata wawu wawa Bachi Jii yo wa ye ri ngawan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Imba Bitrus ka la wa tre kigbu, ran ŋŋron wa, ran tre,&lt;&lt;Kpa ngambi chuwo ri de ya riwa ari ye ri wa meme ti!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Wawa wa kpanyɨme ri tre wan wa sonwatu ima, nga nji wawa wake ngo tra wa sro ngan ri wa ri chachu wan.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Wa ka sron mba yo ri tsro wandu Jii, nga wari ran kabɨrutu nga wari ran ga kabɨruti ri nga bre Izhi. Bibi riwa wa hu Jii wa he.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iki Bibi Riwa wa Hu Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Imirindu Izhi wa ti kyawa wa de sisiri nga wari nzu sron, nga ko ngan a shu ri sisiri. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Wawu wa hu Jii waka kabɨrutu ran hi nga wari vu kpi mba ga ri ngamba. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Wa vu wa kpi mba re, nga wari ka nkɨren wan ka ga ngamba, bibi riwa ko ngan ri su. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ri vi ri vi wa kushu ngamba ki ri bubu bre Izhi, nga wari ri ri ri bubu ri ri ko mba, wa ran ri ri ri kinklan sron, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />wana gbresan nde Jii, nga wari ran ri ro dindi ti wawu nji. Ngha ko wuni vi Bachi ri vu wawa wa kpa wa chuwo sro nga rimi mba.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Bitrus a Den Nji ri bre ri Nkpuzhu Kpa Chuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Chachu ri Bitrus nga Yohana wana hi tra bre ri vi bre ri krefi tra ri Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Imba nji ri riwa a ran to zren ran tu chachu riwa wa ngɨzhi-u, wa ban hu ngamba hi ri nkon tra bre riwa wa yo ri a bi, ritu no ran ibrewawa wa gra ri tra bre. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Riwa a to Bitrus mba Yohana wana gra ri tre bre, ka bre wa nkɨren. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Bitrus ka yau bibi wa Yohana. Imba Bitrus ka tre, &lt;&lt;Ya ta!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Imba isron nji-a ka kɨwan ye ri wa, ran ran gben kya riwa wa no.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Imba Bitrus ka tre, &lt;&lt;Azurfa ko Zinariya me ran he ri wu ran, ama ikya riwa me he ri wu me no-u. Rimi nde Yeso kristo nji Nazare, wulunde zren.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Imba Bitrus ka vu kuwo ri ran nzuu ban shu, imba mgibreri kpɨraza nji-a waka senkpa. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Nji-a ka wulunde za kɨrinde ran gra zren ran ran gbresan nde Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Nji wawu wato a ran zren ran ran gbre Izhi, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />wa to ri a he nji riwa a ran son ri nkontra bre Izhi ran ran bre, nga wa ran ti mamaki ritu kya riwa a ti ri wu.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a Tɨreri Kpanji tra Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Riwa nji- a ngɨzhi Bitrus nga Yohana ri wo ri trankon Solomu, riwa wa yo, nji waka ti mamaki wari tsutsu hi ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Riwa Bitrus a to nganyi, ran tre ri wa ri,&lt;&lt;Biyi wa nji Israila, ritu ngye ko ikya nyi ri no yi mamaki? Ritu ngye ko bi ya ta zhuka a he ri senkpa mbu nye ki no nji nyi no zren? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Izhi wa Ibrahi, Ishaku mba Yakubu, Izhi wa Ti wa Timbu, wa gbre vren ko wan Yeso, wu kawu de nowa wuu, nga wu kawen riwu kusi Bilatu, ko riwa ide a yosron riwa ari chu wu wo. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Ama bi kambi ri nji ri tsitsri nga dindi ti bi ri miyen ri no wa ka nji ri wuu nji chuwo ri yi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Bi wuu Yeso nji ri de vɨri , ama Izhi a no vɨri rimi kuu ki he ri to. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ri yosron rimi nde Yeso, nji nyi riwa bi ya bi ri to a he ri senkpa. A he nde Yeso nde nga yosron riwa a zhu riwu ye riwa a de si ri wu, bibi riwa wawumbi bi to.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Zizan, miri vayi, me to bi ti kya nyi ri bubu, bibi riwa wa rinkon mbi wa ti ngawen. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ama ngye bibi riwa Izhi a tre zi ri sen hu nyu wa la tre Izhi wa tre ri kristo ri so ya. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Nghamba bi Ka meme ti mbi chuwo, bi ri kɨma ye ri Izhi nowa ka meme ti mbi rega ri yi. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Ngha riwa ariya ti Kristo ndu, riwa wa chu ri yi riwa a he Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ama Yeso ri son ri shu tse chachu riwa Izhi ri vu kyawa kishuti, bibi riwa a la nyu ri gbangban mu zu nyu tsitsri nji ri la tre wan. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Musa ngawen a tre ri,&lt;&lt;Bachi Izhi ri zhu riyi ri nji ri la tre rimimbi riwa a he ka ame; dole bi ka sɨrenton ri kongye riwa a tre riyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Ko ngan rimimbi riwa a ran sɨrenton ri tre Izhi ran wa chu wu joo rimi wanji wan.<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />&lt;&lt;Kpunji tre, wa la tre Izhi wawu wawa wa tre, wato zhu ri Samuila ri wawa wa ye kugon, wawumba wa la tre ritu vi wanyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Biyi nye bi he miri gba nkon wa la tre Izhi nga tre riwa Izhi a ka zi ri wa Timbi. A tre ri Ibrahi, &lt;Zu ri gɨzhi mbi nye gbungblu me rife dindi wan. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Riwa Izhi a nzu vrenkowan, a gbuchi ti-undu riyi no yo wo dindi ri yi riwa ari kɨma yi joo ri meme timbi.<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Bitrus mba Yohana kusi wa Bla Tɨre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Riwa Bitrus nga Yohana wandu ri tra Jii ri wa rinkon ri tra bre Izhi ri wa gben nga wa nji waka tifu bran bran riwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />wana tsro nji wari ran tre ritu chachu tashɨme wari ran la ri bibi wa Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Imba waka vu Bitrus nga Yohana, wari kawa sro rimi ko trenji kafi mibreritu riwa yawulu a ti. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ama ikigbu nji rimi wawa wa wo tre Jii wari kpa nyɨme, ikingbumba a he ngo ton.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ri mibreri han wan wa rinkon mba ri wa ngɨzhi kpanchimba nga wawa wa tsro wa tre Jii waka kabru ri Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Ri Hanana, rinkon wandu riko nji, ri kayafa, ri Yohana, ri Iskandary, nga wawa wa miri vayi nji rinkon ri tra Jii. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Riwa wa ngji Bitrus mba Yohana ye kri riwa ri tsutsu, wari wa wa ri tre, &lt;&lt;Ri gbengbren ritan nye, ka ri nde ritan nye, bi ti ngamba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Imba Bitrus a la riwa, a sho ri Wu Tsitsri, &lt;&lt; Wa rinkon riwa kpanchison wanji, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />inde wa wata ri tre luwa ritu riwa ki ti dindi ti ri nchonji nyi, riwa ki den kpa chuwo, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />to, a he riwa bi to, biyi wawu, ri wanyi Israila, ri nde Yeso nji ri Nazara, riwa biyi bi kpan-u ritu konkron nga wawu riwa Iji tashɨme rimi kuu. Ritu wan nye nji nyi kri kusimbi piyan-piyan. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yeso nyen a he tita riwa wa mme mbi wa kamba ri wu, wawu nye he tita nju tra riwa a kpa mme bi.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ikpa nji chuwo he riwa Yeso nye ri kankshi wan; rimi gbungblume wawu nji riwa ari kpata chuwo ran.<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Imba, riwa wa rinkon wa nji Yahuda wa to gbengbren wa Bitrus mba Yohana, wari to iri wana he wawa wa kpan tu ran nye nga wawa wana he kya ran, waka ti kya ri de sisiri, wari la tre mba, ritu riwa wa ran he ri Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ama riwa wa to nji nyi riwa wa den kpa chuwo a kɨri riwa, wari wa bubu ri wa wa senyu gyen. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Imba wa rinkon wa nji Yahuda wa lawa Bitrus nga Yohana iri nowa zhu ri bu shutu kabru, wari nghɨron ngamba ri, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />&lt;&lt;Ko ki ti se ri nji wa nyi? Ritu kpanji wawa wa son ri Urushelima wawu wato kya ri wa ti zu ri wa, ki ran to su wa che ran. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ama ritu no tre nyi no ran shan gra rimi nji ran, de ki fen wan ton nowa ran bru tre ri njo ri nde Yeso ngaran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Imba waka yo Bitrus nga Yohana, iri nowa ran yɨwasi wari tsro rimi nde Yeso ran. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ama wa Bitrus mba Yohana waka kpa nyɨme riwa ri,&lt;&lt;To, inde a tsra ri Jii riwa ki wo ri yi han riwa ki wo ri wawu Jii, bi ka ya to. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ritu kita, tse ki la kya riwa ki wo nga kya riwa kito.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Riwa wa bru fen wa ton, wari kawa chuwo, ritu riwa wa wa bubu riwa wati wa ya gyen ritu nji wa ran gbre nde Jii ritu kya riwa a ti ran. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Inji nyi riwa wati kya ri de sisiri ritu wan riwa wa den kpa chuwo a han se senza.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Huu Izhi wa Bre Izhi ri Gbengbren Mba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Riwa wa ka wa Bitrus mba Yohana chuwo, waka bru wa ngbɨron miri vayi mba hi wari lawa kya riwa wa rinkon tra Jii nga wa kpanchison wa la wa. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Riwa wa hu Izhi wawo nganyi, wari nzu ran mba hi ri Jii ri sron riri, wari tre ri, a wu riwa wu he ri kongye, a wu riwa wu ngɨzhi shuwulu, ri meme ri nchon nne ri wa kyawa riwa wa he rimi mba. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Riwa a zu ri wo Yuu Tsitsri, zu ri wo Doda A ti wa timbu nji rindu wen, wu tre ri,&lt;Ritu ngye ko wawa wana to Jii ran wa ti kyawa wawa wa he kukulu? <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Wa chu wa wa mɨlan ngamba ti ri tiku, wa bla tre wa ka tumba kabru, warari ti kpan fu ri Bachi, ri Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Jaji tre Hirudus nga Buntus Bilatu wa katu kabru rimi gbu ri wawa wana to Jii ran ri wanji Israila wari yoo Yeso kusi. Ivren rindu wen ri tsitsri, riwa wu kɨma-u ti Bachi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Wa katu kabru riwa wati kongye riwa wu ti ri he, ritu gbengbren wen ri tre ri sron wen. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Zizan a wu Bachi, ya fen ton mba, no miriko wen to ti ndu tre wen ri gbengbren. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Wu tsro wo wen wuri ri den nji kpachuwo, wuti kyawa riwa wa de sisiri ri wa kyawa wa mamaki rimi nde vren rindu wen Yeso ri Tsitsri. <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Kugon riwa wa bre Izhi, bubu riwa wa kabru a ran chu. Wawumba Tsitsri Yuu ka he riwa, waka ran la tre Jii ri gbengbren sron mba.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ko Ngye Riwa wa Tɨra Jii he Riri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Ikabɨru nji waa wawu wawa wa kpa tre Jii inyu mba a he riri, injo rimi mba a ran tre ri ikya riri he wama ri kankshe wan ran, kon ngye mba a he riri. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Imiri ndu Jii waka tre wari tsro tre ri gbengbren ritu tashɨme Bachi Yeso rimi kuu. Dindi ti kigbu ritu ko ngan rimi mba, <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />hari ba riri riwa a ran he ri kya rimi mba ran ritu wawumba wawa wa he ri zhu nga koo wa ka re. <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />waka ngɨzhi nkɨren-a ye, wa ka ki kusi wandu Jii, waka vu ga ri wa ko ngan ri kya wa ari wa.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Riwa wa he rimi ngamba tse Yusufu nji ri lawi, a he nji ri meme kubrus, riwa wandu Jii wa yo ri Banaba nji ri yo sron, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />a reri rɨma wan, ran gɨzhi nkɨren-a ye ran kadzi kusi wandu Jii.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Anania mba Safaratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Imba wa ran yo nji rɨ ri Hanania nga wa wan safaratu, riwa wa reri kpimba, <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Imba nyɨme wawan waka ka ngbron kubu kari wari ngji ngbron wan ye sro ri ndoza wa tindu Jii.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Imba Bitrus ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Anania, ingye ti ko wu no meme nji no gra wu isron riwa wu ti che ri wu tsitsri riwa wu ka ngbɨron kubu ki ri ngawen ri mi kubu riwa wu kpa ri rɨma riwa wu reri wu? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Aran he wa me ko wu kareran? Nga kugon ri wa wu kare, kubu-a a ran he wame ran? Ŋgyi ti ko wuti bibi ti nyi? Wuran ti che ri nji ran ama wuti ri Jii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Riwa Anania a wo nganyi, ka kujoku ran kuu, sisiri ka vu nji riwa wa wo kya riwa a ti iwawu branbran. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Imba imiri nze waka ye kusi wari nye kpawan ri tsro, wari ban wu zhu ra wari no yibi.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Riwa a ti awa tra iwa wan ka gra ye, kana to kya riwa a ti ran. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Bitrus ka miye,&lt;&lt;La wen, rinyi nye he rerɨwan riwa bi reriwu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">&lt;&lt;Ka kpa nyɨme ri,&lt;&lt;Een&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A he rewan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Bitrus ka tre riwu,&lt;&lt;wuti se ko wu nyɨme wu ri tsra Tsitsri Yuu Bachi? Tombai! Izanji riwa wano ronwen yibi wa ri nkon tra, wa ban wu zhu ri ra ngawen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Imba meron ka joku ri za wan ran kuu. Imba imirinze waka gra ye wari, fe ka a kuu, waka ban wu zhu ri ra wari no yibi kusan bubu gru ronwan. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Sisiri ka vu nji wa hu Jii wa wa wa wo tre-a wawu bran.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa ti Ndu Izhi wa den Kpan nji Chuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Wa tindu Jii wa ti kyawa wa mamaki nga kyawa wa de sisiri rimi kpanji nga wawa wa kpa tre Jii wasi kabru ri trankon riwa wawu solomu <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Ama rimi gbron nji njo a ran vu sron riwa ari gra ri wa ran, ri nga mba nji wana to mkpen mba. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Wawa wa kpa tre Jii imba ri roran wa ka ran kigbu ran sro ngan. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Ritu ka nyi nji wa vun wa lilo ran ye ri wɨri wari ran sro wa ritu iblakru nga ntanbri ritu no wu Bitrus no ku wa inde a kari hi. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Ikpa nji wa ka kabru ngawen ri wa gbu Jerusalem, wari ngɨzhi wa lilo nga wawa meme bɨzhi ri yowa ya, imba wawu mba waka fe si.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wati Wandu Izhi ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Imba nji rinkon ndu Jii nga kpandu wan, wawa wa henji wawa wa iwa Sadu kiyawa washo ri ngu. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Wa vuu wandu Jii wari sro wa ri tra trenji ri mpwan. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ama riwa ichu a ti wandu Izhi waka ye wari bu wankon tra tren-a wari zhu riwa <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />&lt;&lt;Hi, bi ri ki ri tra Izhi&gt;&gt; A tre,&lt;&lt;Bi ri lanji tireri sisa riwa a ye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Riwa imibrea kpan wa ka gra ri tra Jii, bibi riwa wana la wa, wari gra tsro nji.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Riwa nji rinkon ri tra Jii nga wa zon-u ndu wa ye, wa ka yo wa rinkon kabru ri wa rinkon kabɨrutu wa israila, wari tindu hi ri tra trenji ri nowa ngɨzhi wa ye. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ama riwa wandu ri tra wa hi, wa ka ran fe wa ri tra tre nji ran, wa ya wa ri ye lawa ri, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Ki ka to tra tren-a wa tren-u gbengben, wa gben wa ki ri nkon tra, ama riwa ki bu wa ki ran to njo ri mwan ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Riwa wa rinkon wa ndu Jii wa wo nganyi, waka ran to bibi riwa ikya a ri he ran.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Imba nji ri ka ye ran tre,&lt;&lt;Tomba! nji riwa bi yowa ri tra tre waki ri tra Jii wari ri tsro nji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Imba wa rinkon wandu ri tra Jii ri gbron wandu waka hi wari ka ngɨzhi wandu Jii ye, ama a ran he ri gbengbren ran ritu riwa wa ti sisiri gbron ji riwa wa ka ta wa ri tita.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Riwa wa ngɨzhi wa ndu Jii ye kusi warinkon imba rinkon nji ri ka miye wa ri, ki gbi yi mvumvu ton no yi ran bru tsro rimi nde nyi <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />&lt;&lt; Ki fen yi ton ri ran tsro ri nde nyi ran,&gt;&gt;Ka tre, &lt;&lt;Bi tsro wa nji Urushelima ri tsro mbi,bi ri ri wa bi ri ka alaki yi nji nyi chan ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Ama Bitrus nga mgbɨon mba waka ta ri,&lt;&lt;kita ki hu tre Jii han tre nji! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Iji riwa wati mbu a ta Yeso shɨme rimi kuu riwa bi kpan-u wuu rikpa konkron. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Wawu nye iji no kuwo riwan, rinkon nga Nji ri kpanji chuwo ritu riwa a bu nkon ri israila wa ka meme timba chuwo wa ka ka meme timba rega riwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Kita ki he wa shada kyawa wanyi, nga Tsitsri Yuu ngawen riwa Izhi no wa wa wa wo tre wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Riwa ndu Izhi wa wo nganyi waka ti fu wari wa riwa wa wuu wa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ama nji Farisa ri riwa wa yo ri Gamaliya, nji ri tsro riwa nji wawu wa nyɨme wu, a wulunde krinde ran tre kusi wa rinkon ri nowa no wandu Izhi wanyi zhu ri ra tsa wen ri. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Imba ka tre riwa ri:&lt;&lt;Biyi wanji israila, kɨma ya bi ri to kya riwa bi hi ran ti ri nji wa nyi. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ivi vu yiwa wari tudas a ye, ran tre ri wawu he kyari nga nji gbigba nza waka ka ngamba nga riwu. Waka wuu, wawa wa huu-a waka shan, nga tre-a wawu ka he kukulu. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />kugon wan Yahuda nji Galili ka ye rivi riwa wa ran bla nji ran gyuru nji wari waka gbundo hu, wawu ngawen ka ku wawa wa hu wawu waka vɨra wa <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Imba rimi tre ri zizan me ŋɨron-u kanji wanyi chuwo! nowa hi! inde wa ti kya rimi kpa ari joku <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ama inde a he riwa Jii bi ran to zu wa ran; bi to ka bi wanyu ri Izhi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Tre wan a si wa sron wa yo gra wari tsi wa wari rimi nde Yeso ran, wari chu wa wo nowa hi nga mba. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Wandu Jii wa ka ka wurunde Jii waka ka wurunde kusi wa bla tre ri kunkɨlan sɨla wa sron rimi soya ritu nde wan. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Bla vi, ko rimi tra Izhi ko rimi koo wana ka tre tre Izhi nga wana ka tsro trewan chuwo zari ran, wana tre ri Yeso nye he Bachi.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ichu nji Tamgban wa wiwɨri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ivi wa sen riwa wandu Izhi wa kigbu; wa gbu ri wa wa yo wa ri nji Yahuda wa ka nji wa ri tre nji Yahuda iri wa ran ka wan ya imba ri wa ronron mba wa kuu ran ri bubu ga kpi ko ki bla vi. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Imba wandu Izhi wuru don hari mba waka yo nji wa hu Jii wawu, wari tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ai a ran bi riwa kita wa hu Izhi ki ka bla tre Izhi chuwo riwa ki ran gben ritu kpanchi ri ri <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Miri vayi, chu nji tamgban rimi mbi wawa wa towa wa sho ri Yuu Tsitsri nga wiwɨri ki ka ndu nyi sa wa riwo <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />nga ki ri yo sron mbu ri bre ri tsro tre.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Tre nyi ka ro ri gbu nji. Waka chu Istifanu nji riwa a sho ri yo sron nga Yuu Tsitsri, Filibu, ri Burokoras, ri Nikanari, ri Timan, ri Baminas, ri Nikolas nji riwa a zhu ri Antakiya riwa ri sen a gra ri nji Yahuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Waka kanji wanyi no wandu Jii waka bre Izhi wari sa wa wo ritu mba.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Imba tre Jii ka shan Urushelima wa ka ran kigbu gbagbla, nga wa hu Izhi kigbu waka wo tre-a wari yo sron.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Rinkon nji Yahuda wa vu Istifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Imba istifanus nji riwa Izhi a ti dindi ti ri wu mba gbengbren wan, a ti kyawa wa wulu siron nga kyawa wa de sisri rimi nji. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Idan nyu ka gra ri wawa wa he wa tra bre wa wayou ri itra bre ri liba rtiyawa wa kuraniyawa ri Alekzandiriya yowa, nga wari wa meme kilikiya nga Asiya riwa wa ran janyu ri Istifanus <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ama wa ran to kiri ri wu ri janyu ri tu riwa a tireri wiwɨri, Iyu a ran chu kpa.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Imba wa ka gyuru nji wari ri yayibi nowa tireri,&lt;&lt; Kiwo tre ri kpande time ritu Musa mba Jii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ngmba nye wa no sron nji waka tɨme nga wa rinkon, ri wa tsro tre doka Musa, wawa nga waka vuu wari ngɨzhi-u ye kusi wa bla tre. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Waka ngɨzhi wa ti che, nowa la ri nji nyi ran ka kpan nga tre doka Musa chuwo ran. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ritu kiwo-u ari tre ri rinyi he Yeso nji ri Nazareari dzi bubu nyi, ran sran kyawa riwa Musa a ka don rita.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wawa wa bla tre waka sro si Istifanu, wa ri ti sisri wan a zhu si miri ndu Izhi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Tre Istifanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Imba rinkon wandu Jii a mɨye, Istifanu,&lt;&lt;A he nganyi nye?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Isifanu ka tre,&lt;&lt;Biyi miri vayi riwa rinkon, sren ton bi ri wowen Izhi riwa wa gbresan wan a ye ri ti wa Timbu Ibrahi ri vi riwa a he ri gbu Mesofotamiya tu ka a ran son ri gbu Hana ran. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Ka tre riwu,&lt;Wurunde ri meme mbi, rimi miri vayimbi, hi ri meme riwa me tsro wu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />&lt;&lt;Imba ka wurunde zhu ri meme ka Kaldiyawa ran son ri Hana ri bubu wan, kugon ri meme riwa bi ki rimi wan zizan. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ama wawu ri tuwan, a ran no gado wan ko za riri ran, tsede a lo tre zi ri wawu ri ka chuwo riwu wawu ri wa gɨzhi wan wa kugon, ama ri vi wan a ran he ri vren ran. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Ikya riwa Iji a tre, iri igɨji Ibrahi wa hi tsɨren ri gbu ri wa gbu wa kɨma wa ti gran wari nowa ya ri se gbigba nza. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />&lt; Hari luwanga,&gt;Izhi a tre,&lt;Ikpanji wawa wa yowa ya, ame me nowa ya kugon nganyi wa zhu ye wari kɨbu mgbazhu rimo ri bubu wan.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Nga ka ka tre zi ritu fon nju ritu nganyi,riwa ibrai a ngji Ishaku, a fon wu nzhu rivi ri tandra Ishaku a ngji wa ti wa timbu wuru don hari wanyi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Wa ti wa ti wanyi, wa ran tingu ri Yusufu hi ri gbu Masar, ama Izhi a he riwu,. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />A zhu riwa rimi ya wan wawu ran no kinklan yi nga wiwɨri kusi Friyona, ichu Masari wawu Friyona ka no rinkon ri Masari ran kanji wa ko wan sro riwo wan wawu.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />&lt;&lt;Imba iyon ka gra ri meme Masar nga kaana ritu nchon ya hari wati wa Timbu wana fe ri ran. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ama riwa Yakubu a wo ri iri he ri Masar ran ti wa ti wa Timbu ri gbuchi. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ri himba ri hari Yusufu ka kangawan la miri vayi wan, Friyona ka to bubu riwa Yusufu a zhu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Imba Yusufu ka tindu hi ri tiwan Yakubu no ye ri miri vayi wan wawu nji se tangban don ton. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Tse Yakubu ka Masar ri muu nye ka kuu, wawu iwa wa ti wa timbu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Imba waka vuwa bru hi shekem, wari nowa yɨwi ri wa Ibrahi a reri nkirem riwo miri Hamor ri shekem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />&lt;&lt;Ama riwa ivi riwa Izhi a tre zi ri Ibrahi a ye nji waka kigbu bla bubu bran ri meme Masar, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Hari waka ti chu ri Masar riwa a ran to ko ngan nye he Yusufu ran. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ichu nyi a sen wa gbu mbu ran zhu riwa ri fu wan, ŋenŋen mba, ritu nowa ran nawo ran.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />&lt;&lt;Rivi-a nye waka ngɨzhi Musa shisha vren, waka mɨlan-u ngɨzhi ti huwa tra ri ko tiwan. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Riwa wa zhu riwu ngɨzhi-u ka ri rinyu nne ivɨra Friyona a ka to-u ran ban wu ye ran mɨlan-u ngɨzhi ka ivren wan. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Waka tsro Musa tre bibi riwa wanji ri Masar wawu a he nji riwa a he ri gbengbren rimi tre ri ndu wan.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />&lt;&lt;Riwa Musa a vu se senza, tre a ye riwu no hi ri miri vayi wan israilawa. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Riwa a to wana sen vayi wan, ka gra kusi vayi wan riwa wa sen-ua ran kpawo wan ran tsi nji ri Masar wuu. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />A yonga imiri vayi wan wato ri Izhi ri kpawa chuwo zu riwo wan ama wa ran to ran <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ri mibreri han wan wari wana wanyu ri ngamba, ka wa ran ga wa a tre,&lt;&lt;Biyi miri nji Bi he miri vayi nye fa, ngye ti ko bi sen ngambi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />&lt;&lt;Ama riwa a ran sen vayi wan ka tru Musa, ran tre,&lt;ngaa nye nowu rinkon nga bla tre ritu mbu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ka wu wa wuri wuu wen bibi riwa wu wuu nji ri Masar iren? <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Riwa Musa a wo tre-a tse ka wulutsu hi ri meme Medayana, ri bubu riwa a ngɨzhi miriron hari.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />&lt;&lt; Kugon riwa a ti se senza, Iyu ri ndu Izhi ka Juu ye riwu ka rɨme wulu ri nkpuzhu konkron, ri wulu ri ji ri tita sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Riwa Musa a to nganyi, ran ti sisiri kya riwa a to. Ran chiwi ye riwa ari yo, a wo ran Bachi ri tre ri: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;Ame me he Jii wa Ti wa Ti wen, Iji riwa Ibrahi nga Ishaku ri Yakubu.&gt;Ikpa Musa ka gra ri tsiri mgbimɨri a ran to ya ran. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />&lt;&lt;Imba Bachi ka tre riwu ri,&lt;Juu ntan za wen, ritu bubu riwa wu he nyi a he tsitsri bubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Kpunji tre me to bibi ya riwa wa no nji won riwa wa ri Masar, me wo kpachumba, me ri gɨzhi riwa me kpawa chu wa zizan ye me ri tiu ndu hi ri Masar.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />&lt;&lt;Imba Musa riwa wa kamba riwu, wari ran tre ri,&lt;Nghan zi-u chu nga nji ri bla tre ritu mbu? wawu nye Iji tiu ndu no he nji riwa ari he rinkon nga nji riwa ari kpanji chuwo, ritu zon riwa Iyu rindu Jii riwa a ye riwu rimi ji. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Wawu nye zhu riwa, a ti kyawa wa de sisiri riwa a no nji mamaki ri meme Masar nga Ba Maliya nga rimi ji, hari ise senza.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />&lt;&lt;Rinyi nye he Musa riwa a tre ri Israilawa iri,&gt;Iji ri chu nji ri ndu ri rimi miri vayi mbi, bibi riwa a chu wen.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Wawu nye he ri tra Jii nyan rimi ji mba vrendu Jii riwa a tre riwu ri tita sinai ri wa Ti wa Timbu nye a kpa tre ri jaji wan ye rita.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />&lt;&lt;Ama wati wa Timbu wa kamba ri kpa tre wan, wari tru yo gran, isron mba ka kɨma hi ri meme Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Nji waka tre ri Haruna ri,&lt;Ti gbugblu ri ta riwa wa ngɨzhi ta zren, ritu Musa mba riwa a zhu rita ri Masar, ki ran to kya riwa a fe ran!&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ri vimba waka me bu lando ri, wa han wa nɨwan riwa wa ti lɨbu sro riwu sro vɨrewari ran ran ti kinklan sron ri ndu riwa wa ti riwo mba. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ritu nganyi Iji a kɨma gon ti wa ran kawa chuwo ri hu ntsen huwa, bibi riwa a he rimi mbe wa la tre Jii ri, biyi wanji Israila, ame nye bi han nɨma, bi ri sro yi hari se senza rimi ji?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Bi no mpɨwan molek mkp</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Ri bibi ntsen riwa nji wa tiu ri wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">riwa bi ritu ngambi riwa bi ran kɨbu mgbazhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ame me kɨma yi ban ku gon Babila.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />&lt;&lt;Wati wa Timbu wa ri tiranga ri ji, bibi riwa nji riwa a tre nyi iwa Musa a tre ri nowa tre tsra ri ri bibi riwa a to. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Itranga nyi nye wati watimbu wa riwu, waka ngɨzhi-u ye ri meme nyi ri vi Joshuwa, kugon riwa wa ngɨzhi meme risimba Itiranga nyi a he hari ye ri vi Doda, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Riwa a fe zon riwo Izhi hari ran wa zon riwa ari me bubu bre Izhi riwa Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ama Sulemanu nye a me tra ri Izhi.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />&lt;&lt; Ndu ritu ngangin nji riwa wa gbre wu ran ri son ri wa ko nga me riwa nji bibi riwa nji ri la tre Jii Ishaya a tre:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;&lt;Iji a tre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">ishu nga meme he bubu yo dza won.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Bubu tan nye riwa bi mme ri mo?</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="ACT 7:49">Ka bubu tan nye he bubu son vɨri won?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Aran he rimi gbengbren won nye me ti kyawa wanyi ran?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Istifanu a tre&lt;&lt;Biyi wa han ton, wawa irimɨren mba kunyɨren, wa wa wa kawo, bla vi bi kambi ri bibi riwa wati wa Timbi wati bibi wan nye biyi bi ti! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Rimi wa la tre Jii ritan nye wati wa Timbi wa ran nowa ya ran? Wa wuu wawa wa la tre ye nji ri kpunji tre-a, riwa bi ri amana wan zizan ri wawa wa wuu-u. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Biyi nye bi kpa tre doka Musa riwa miri ndu Izhi wa no Musa ama bi ran hu ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa ta Istifanu ri Tita Wuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Riwa wa rinkon wa nji Yahuda wawo kyanyi, waka tifu bran bran, wari tan nyiri ritu fu ri wu. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ama istifanu sho ri wu tsitsri, ran sɨri si ri shu, ran to mkpen Jii ri Yeso a kɨri kuri kuwori Jii. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />&lt;&lt;Imba Istifanu ka tre,&lt;&lt;Ingye ngha-en, me to shu bu nga vren nji ku wo ri Izhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ama waka kpagro bran wari hɨma ton ba wari wulu riwu ri tre mba riri, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Wari zhu riwu kugon gbu wari sondu ta ri tita wawa isimba ki ri vren ze ri, riwa wa yo ri shawulu.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Riwa wa ran ta Istifanu ri tita wawu kana bre Izhi, ran ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;A wu Bachi Yeso, kpa wu won.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Imba Istifanu ka kɨbu ngbazhu, ran nzu ran bran, ran tre,&lt;&lt; Bachi ran yo meme ti nyi&gt;&gt; a la nganyi tse ran kuu.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Shawulu a ran sho-gon nowa wuu Istifanas</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Nji wa shan ritu Riwa wa ran wuu wa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Chachu mba nchon tre ri a zhu ri tra Jii riwa a he ri urushelima, nji wawa waka shan ri meme Yahudiya nga Samariya. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Imba nji wari wa ti sisri Izhi waka ban Istifanu no yɨbi, wari yi kuu wan bran bran. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ama shawulu ka sondu no wa hu Jii ya bran bran, a gra riko ran gbi mba ri ronron ran sro rimi tra tre nji.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibu a tsro tre Izhi Ri Gbu Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Imba wawa wa zuwa waka shan-a, waka shan gra wari ran tre tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filibu a hi gbu riwa wa yo ri Samariya, ran ran tre tre Kristo riwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Riwa nji wa wo, wa ri to kyawa riwa Filibu a ran ti ri de sisri, ri sron mba riri wa kpa kya riwa ari lawa. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Imba meme bɨzhi wa shnji waka kanji kigbu chuwo, meme bɨzhi waka sondu ran kpagɨro wa lilo gblu kpa nga wa nkpuzhu kigbu wa den wa kpa chuwo. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ritu ngamba waka sondu ti kinklan sron bran bran rimi gbu Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sima nji ri Ti Gbugblu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Nji ri a he, wana yo ri Sima, riwa a ran ti gbugblu risen rimi gbu, hari a ran no nji Samariya sisiri, a ran tre riwa ri wawu nye he kpunjiwan, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />nji wawu waka kɨma sron mba ye riwu, wa mkpen riwa ya wana tre ri, &lt;&lt;Nji nyi, ai, gbengbren nyi nye he gbengbren zhi, riwa wa yo ri rigra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Imba waka yosron mba riwu, ritu riwa a ti vi hari riwa ari ti kyawa ri wa ari nowa sisiri ri gbugblu wan. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ama riwa wa kpa nyɨme ri tre Izhi riwa Filibu a ti ritu kpanchison riwa Izhi nga nde Yeso, waka sonwa ri ima wawu ri mba ri ronron. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Ka hu ri Sima ri tuwan ka kpa nyɨme, kugon riwa wa son wu ri ima kaka ngawan ngan ri Filibu. Riwa a to wa kyawa riwa wana ti ri de sisiri, a ti mamaki bran<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Riwa wa rinkon wa tra Jii wawa wa he ri Urushelima, wa wo ri wanji Samariya wa kpa tre Izhi, waka tru wa Bitrus mba Yohana hi riwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Riwa wa Bitrus mba Yohana wa ye Samariya wa ri bre Izhi riwa don nowa kadon fe Wu Tsitsri. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Ri son watu ri ima riwa wa son wa rimi nde Bachi Yeso, ama Iyu Tsitsri a ran gra rɨ rɨ ri rimimba rina. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Imba Bitrus nga Yohana wa ka kawo mba yo ritu mba,waka kpa Yuu Tsitsri.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />To, riwa Sima a to, ashe, ri sawo warinkon tra Jii nye wa de Wu Tsitsri imba ka chu kubu no wa Bitrus mba Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />a tre, &lt;&lt;Nowen gbengbren nyi ngawen, ritu nde me sawo ri ko ngan ritu, ka fe Yuu Tsitsri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ama Bitrus ka tre riwa:&lt;&lt;Biyi mbi kubu mbi, kuu yi, bi yonga ri kubu bi nye bi fe nde Jii! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Iima wen ran he ri bibi nyi ran ritu riwa isron wen ran he riri kusi Jii ran. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ritu kamba ka meme ti wen chuwo ritu meme ndu wen, bre Bachi ka ari ka meme ti wen rega riwa ikya riwa wu ka zi rimi sron wen. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Me tou wu he ŋchi kya riwa ari nye, wu he rimi tre rimi meme ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Sima ka kpa nyɨme ri,&lt;&lt;Bre Izhi rimo no kyawa riwa bi tre mbari no ran fe wen ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Riwa wa rinkon ri tra Jii wa to tre Jii a he, waka tre zhu, wari bru hi ri Urushelima, wari ran tre tre Jii ri gbu wa kusan Samariya kigbu.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibu mba nji ri Habasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ivren ri ndu Jii ri ka tre ri Filibu, &lt;&lt;Wulunde, hi kusi yawulu hu nkon riwa a zhu ri Urushelima hi ri Gaza,&gt;&gt;Wato nkon ri kukulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Imba Filibu a kɨma ngawan ti ran ran hi ri nkon. Riwa a ran hi ran fe nji rinkon ri Habasha riwa wawu ngawen a ran hi Jerusale Inji rinkon-a nye a he nji ri ya nkɨren riwa chu mba riwa wa yo ri Kandakatu, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />a bru ran ye ko riwa a son ritu nkan ŋma wan, a ran kɨra mbe Ishaya nji ri tindu Jii. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Iyu Tsitsri ka tre ri Filibu,&lt;&lt;Chiwi hi kusan ŋma mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Imba Filibu ka wulutsu hi riwu, a wo riwa a ran kra mbe Ishaya nji rindu Jii, ran tre. &lt;&lt;Wu to kya riwa wu kɨra mba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Nchon nji-a Ka tre riwu, &lt;&lt;Imiyin? tsede njo lawen tu wan.&gt;&gt; Imba ka bre Filibu iri no wawa ki mba-u.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Rinyi nye he gbre tre riwa a ran kra:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">&lt;&lt;Wa gbi wu ka ntɨma hi ri bubu riwa wa han,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Bibi riwa vi ŋkshu ri son ri ŋgbaŋgbii ri wo nji riwa a ngɨzhi wu ri han ko nyu wan ran bu ran.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Wa tsiri wari ka kpunji wan nyon-u.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ngha rito de njo tre wan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ritu riwa wa ran no son ri gbungblume me nyi ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Imba nji ri nkpen-a ka tre ri Filibu ,&lt;&lt;wori wan, nji rindu Jii nyi, a he tre ngye nye ari tre? Ari tre ritu wan ka ritu njo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Imba Filibu ka bu nyu ran tre riti mbe nyi ran gbuchi ri gbre nji ri gra tre nyi, a ran tre tre Yeso.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Riwa wa he rimi zren, waka ye zhu ri ima, imba nji ri nkpen-a ka tre, &lt;&lt;To ma! ngye riti ko bi ran vuwen son ima ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filibu ka tre riwu, &lt;&lt;Nde wu kpa nyɨme ri sron riri, ai waka ti riwu.&gt;&gt;Nji ri nkpen-a ka tre,&lt;&lt;Me kpa nyɨme ri Yeso he vren Jii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Tse ka de doka iri nowa kukri ri ghɨma. mba ngamba waka gre hi ri mi ima, Filibu mba nji ri nkpen, ka vu son ri ima. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Riwa wa zhu rimi ima, iyu Jii ka zhu rimi ima Iyu Tsitsri ka ban Filibu hi, nji ri nkpen-a ka ran bru to Filibu ngaran. tse ka zren ran hi ran ti kinklan sron. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ama waka to Filibu ri Azotus. tse ka gra kagon wa gbu, ran bla tre Izhi hari ran ka zhu Kaisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Shawulu a ka Memeti Chuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Shawulu, a sondu ran la wa hu Izhi ritu riwa ari wawu ri wuu wa, ran hi ri rinkon wa hu Izhi ri <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />a bre wu iri no ngan mbe ri wawu nowa ngɨzhi hi no wa tra Izhi ri Damasiku, iri inde wawu fe wawa wa hunkon nyi, ko rinkon ko mba, wawu ri ngɨzhi wa ye rimi gbu Urushelima rimi tra lo nji. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Riwa Shawulu a he hɨyeyureri Damasiku, mba bibi kpan wulu ri ka zhu rishu ran kpan kagon wan. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Imba ka joku, ran wo ran rɨ ri tre riwu, &lt;&lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, ingye ti ko wu no wen ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Shawulu ka tre, &lt;&lt;wu he ngan, a wu Bachi?&gt;&gt; Imba ka tre, &lt;&lt;Ame me he Yeso riwa wu no wen ya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt; Ama wurunde gra ri gbu, ri muu nyen wa la-u kya riwa wu ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wa kpan zren wan waka wa kya ri tre hegyen, wa ran wo ran, ama wa ran to njo ran. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Imba Shawulu ka wulunde, ama riwa a bu si ka ran to tsu ran. Imba waka ngɨzhi-u ri kpala hi ri Damasiku. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Ivi wan tra a ran to tsu ran, a ran ri ri ran a ran so ima ran.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Nji ri hu ri Izhi ri Damasiku, wana yo ri Hananiya. Bachi a tre wu rimi raa ri &lt;&lt;Hananiya!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">&lt;&lt;Wawu ka tre, Me kpa nyɨme, wu Bachi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Bachi ka tre riwu ri, &lt;&lt;Wulunde hi ko Yauza wuri miyen Shawulu nji ri Tarsus riwa ari bre Izhi ri bubu wan. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Hari rimi raa wan a ton nji ri, riwa wa yo ri Hananiya, a ye ran yo wo ri wu ritu no to tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Imba Hananiya ka tre,&lt;&lt;A wu Bachi, Me sondu wo tre nji nyin ri ŋyum nji kigbu, ritu meme ti wan riwa a ti ri wa tsitsri wen ri Urushalema. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ko eron wa rinkon wa gbuchi no kon no lo ko ŋnan riwa ari bre Izhi rimi nde wen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ama Bachi ka tre ri Hananiya,&lt;&lt;Wulunde hi fe Shawulu ri lau ri me chu wu no he vren ri ndu won. No la nji wawa wa ran to Izhi ran. Ari la wa chu ritu won. ran la wa nji Israila ritu won. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Ritu riwa me lau bibi kpa ya riwa ari so ritu nde won.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Imba Hananiya ka hi, ran gra riko Yahuda. Riwa a yo wo riwu ri tu, ran tre,&lt;&lt;A wu Vayiwon Shawulu, Bachi nyen tiwendu, wato Yeso, riwa a fe wu rinkon riwa wu hu ye, ritu riwa wu bru to tsu, nowa shuwu ri Yuu Tsitsri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Imba megyen ron ikya a he ka ŋkɨbu a zhu ri si wan joku, imba ka bru to tsu. mba ka wulunde, waka son wu ri ima, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Imba ka ri bi ri, isenkpa wan ka bru ye wu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu a la Tre Izhi ri Damasiku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu a ti vi gbre ri wa hu Izhi wawa wa ri Damasiku. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Imba meron ka gra tre tre Yeso rimi wa tra Izhi mba ri, Yeso he vren Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wawa wa wo-u wawu waka gra ti Tsisri, wari tre,&lt;&lt;Ashe, a ran he nji nyi nye a vɨra wa bre Izhi ri nde nyi ri Urushelima ran? A ye rinyi riwa ari vu wa lo hi kusi wa rinkon ndu Izhi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Shawulu ka bru ran ŋɨmo sron nji Yahuda wa wa wa he ri Damasiku, a ran tre riwa ri Yeso nye he Bachi.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Kugon riwa wati vi hari nji Yahuda wa ka kabɨrunyu iri nowa wuu Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Riwa Shawulu afe wo kya riwa wa zontu ri wawu. Richu ri Izhi wana gben ri nkon gra rigbu riwa wa wuu. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ama riwa ichu a ti miriko wan waka ngɨzhi hu, wari son-u zu ku windo riwa a he ri kpa gɨzhi rimi nchon sisen.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Riwa a ye ri Urushelima ran wa riwa ari gra ri tsutsu wau Izhi, ama nji waka ti sisiri wan wawu ritu riwa wana nyɨme ri a he vayi mba ran. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ama Banaba ka vu riwo ran ngɨzhi hi ri wa rinkon ndu Izhi ran lawa bibi riwa Shawulu a to to Bachi rinkon ri bibi riwa Bachi tre riwu, ri bibi tre tre Izhi riwa a tre ri Damasiku ri sron wan riri rinde Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Rimba Shawulu ka gra kabru tu riwa ri Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />A ran tre tre Izhi ba sisri rinde Bachi Aran tre ri nji Yahuda wawa wawo Helenanci, ran ran wankon riwa wa wuu. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Riwa imiri vayi wa to kamba wari ngɨzhi Shawulu ye ri kaisariya, wari truu hi ri Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Imba nye nji wa hu Jii ri meme Yahudiya, ri Galili, ri Samariya waka fe si, a zon wa ngbajiran, wa ran zren ri kyawamba Tsitsri ritu wa kɨlu sisiri Jii Iyu ri Tsitsri a ran zon wa, hari waka shan kigbu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus den Iniyas Kpa Chuwo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Mbaron, Bitrus riwa a kagon wa gbu wawu, nga ran hi Tsitsri nji wawa wason ri lidda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ri bubu wan ka fe nji ri, riwa wana yo ri Iniyasu, riwa a kru mme ti se tandɨra, a he ri lilo klu kpa. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Imba Bitrus ka tre Iniyasu ri, &lt;&lt;Iniyasu, Yeso kpau chuwo wulunde wuri ban bla ri kru wen. &gt;&gt; Rimba ka wurunde kari meron. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Nji lidda wawu nga wa meme saron waka tou, wari kɨma ye ri Bachi.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ri yafa Iwa ri hu Jii ri a he, inde wan a he Tabita, wato Dokas. Iwa-a a he ri sron dindi, nga ran zon nji wa ya. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Rivi mba-a a ran he ri sikpa ran, a kuu riwa wa suukpa, wari kau yo ritu bubu kru ri ko ri shu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Ritu riwa meme Lidda a he kusan Yafa, riwa wau Jii wawo ri Bitrus he rinkon bubu wan wari ti nji hari hi riwu, no ran wu vi ran no ye ri wawa.<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Imba Bitrus ka wulunde huwa. Riwa a ye bubu wan waka ngɨzhi-u hon hi ri tra ri shu, imba wawa wa romba waku iwawu waka ki kusan wan, wari ranyi wari ran tsro watsro ri su ri rilo riwa wawu Dokas a ti riwa ka wa wawa.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ama Bitrus ka zhu riwa wawu ri ra, ran kɨbu ngbazhu, ran bre Izhi. Ran kɨma hi ri kɨmo Thabita-a ran tre.&lt;&lt;Tabita, wulunde.&gt;&gt; Ka bu si, riwa a to Bitrus, ran wulunde sonnde. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />A no wo ran nzuu dzi nde. Tse ran yo wa Tsitsri ri mba wawa waron mba wa kuu ran kau nowa ri si. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Tre mba ka shan gra rigbu Yafa, ikpanji wa ka kpa nyɨme ri tre Bachi. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Imba Bitrus ka son ti vi bran ri yafa riko nji ri riwa a ran tindu ntan riwa wana yo ri Sima.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Wa Bitrus Mba Karniliyas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Nji ri a he ri Kaisariya, inde wan a he Karniliyas, a he nji ri senkpa rimi wa lokpa wawa wana yowa ri Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Wawu a he nji riwa a ka sron wan no Izhi wawu, iwa wa ko wan wana klu Izhi wawumba, a ran noji sɨraka ri sron riri, ran-ran bre Izhi ran bla vi. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Chachu ri mba ri krefi tra ri ji, a to vren ndu Izhi ri rimi ra ri tsukɨchiji, a gra ye, ran tre riwu, &lt;&lt;A wu Karniliyas!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Sisiri ka tiu ka sro si ri wu, ran tre, &lt;&lt;A wu Bachi, a-en gye?&gt;&gt; Ivren rindu Izhi ka tre riwu. &lt;&lt;Ibre won ri sɨraka wen zhu kusi Jii, wa he kyawa wa tika ri wu. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Zizan, ti wanji wa yafa ndu nowa yo Sima, riwa wa yo ri Bitrus. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />A gɨzhi riko Sima nji ri huntan, riwa iko wan a he rinyun nne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Riwa ivren rindu Izhi a tre riwu ran he, kayo miriko wan hari, ri soja ri riwa a ka sron wan no Izhi rimi wawa wa tindu riwu bla vi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Riwa karniliyas a lawa kongye, ran tiwandu hi ri meme Yafa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ito hi kusi riwa Bitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Riwa wa rimi hi ri gbege ji ri mibreri han wan, wati hue hɨreri gbu, tse Bitrus ka hon ri rishu tra riwa ari bre Izhi, ri gbege ji. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />I yon ka vu mba ka wa ran ri kya, riwa he rimi ti bi ri, ira ka ye riwu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />A to Shuwuru ka yɨra ti hari, ran ran gɨzhi ka nchon tsro ri ka kpa wa turu ran ye meme ri nju wan nzu. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Rimi wan ko inɨma bibi tan wa ri wa wa wa gban rɨme, ri wa chenchen. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Imba ka wo iran ri ri tre riwu ri, &lt;&lt;Bitrus, wurunde, wuu wuri tan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ama Bitrus ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;onhon, a wu Bachi, meran tan kya riwa waon tsiri wu ri riwa wa shɨmau zari ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Imba ka bru wo ran, mkpa ri hari, a tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ikya riwa Izhi tsɨri-u, ran tre ri wana tsiri-u.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Riwa wati nganyi mkpa tra, waka ban wu hi ri shu me gyen ron.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Ikya a ka no Bitrus shnji sron riyu ko ira bibitan nyen ye riwu, tse ga wanji wawa Karnillyas tiwandu waka ki rinko tirankon, wa gbuchi ka miye ko sima-e. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Wati selema, wari miye ko ka rinyi nyen he ko nji riwa wayou ri Bitrus.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Riwa Bitrus a he rimi rimɨren ra wan, Iyu ka tre riwu &lt;&lt;ngyen nji tra wa wau mba. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Wurunde, gɨzhi, hi wawa, ran chu sron joo ran, ritu ame nyen me tiwandu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Bitrus ka gɨzhi ye rnji wa-a ran tre riwa &lt;&lt;ngye ame-e, bi wa wen ntsen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Wa ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Inji ri senkpari nyen, wa yo ri karniliyas, nji ndindi, nji riwa a ri ti sisiri Izhi, riwa wanji nji Yahuda wa gbre wu wawu nye tsitsri nji ri la tre Izhi a lau, a tiundu no hi kowan nowo tre wen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Imba Bitrus ka ngɨzhi wa gra waka gɨzhi ri mibrerɨa wan wa wurunde hi iwawa, mirin vayi riwa wa zhu ri yafa wa kau gon.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus riko Karniliyas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Rimibreri han wan waka gra ri kaiseriya wawu Karniliyas a ran taka mba hari ran yo miri vayi wan ri wa kpan wan. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Bitrus ri gra ri ko mba karniliyas ka yefeu rinkon, ku kusi wan, ran kɨbu mgbazhu riwu. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ama Bitrus ka zuu wurunde, ran tre,&lt;&lt;Wulunde, ai ame ngawen me henji.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Wana tre mba Bitrus, ka gra ran fe nji kigbu ka wa kabru ki. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Ka tre riwa,&lt;&lt;Biyi ngawen bi to a ran bi no nji Yahuda no kabru, ko no hi ri nji ri riwa a he rɨme ri kan. Ama a tsron wen nowen me tre ri jo ri a ran he ri tsitsri, ko nji riwa wa shɨma ran. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ritu kamba riwa wa wawen, me ye, meran kawon ran. To, zizan mesu meri wo kya riwa bi yo wen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Imba Karniliyas ka tre, &lt;&lt;Ruwa he vi ri tra nyen een. A tsra kayin meran bre Izhi ri krefi tra ri yawuru ri kowon, tsa ga nji ri a kri kusi won a su tsro riwa ari nban si ririri. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />A tre, &lt;&lt;A wu Karniliyas ibrewen wa kpa nyime riwu sɨraka wen a he kya ri taka ri Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Ritu kamba, tindu hi yafa nowa yo Sima riwa wa yo ri Bitrus, no gɨzhi riko Sima riwa ari huntan rinyu nne.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ba wuvi tse me tindu ye riwu, wu milan riwa wuye. To zizan ingye kita wawu ki ye kusi Izhi don kiri wo kya ri wa Izhi la riwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a la Tre Izhi riko Karniliyas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Bitrus ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Kpunji tre me to ri Izhi ran ri sutu ran. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ama ko gbu watan iwawu wawa wati sisiri Izhi nga wawa wa mɨlan zren mba zren Izhi ri kpawa. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Izhi a tru tre wan rnji wa Israila, nowa tre tre ri so sisron zu riwo Yeso Alimasiu, wawu nyen he Bachi riwa ko ngan. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Biyi bi to tre nyin riwa a shan gra meme Yahudiya iwawu, wa gbuchi ri meme Galili, ri kugon riwa wa son Yohana rima ka tre tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Wato tre Yeso nji Nazara, bibi riwa Izhi a gban wu ri nye nga Wu ri Tsitsri nga mgbenmgbren ri bibi riwa a sondu kagon rindu ri ndindi ti, a ran den wawa wa ri lilo bɨzhi kpa chuwo wawu, ritu wa Iji a he riwu.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Kita ki he wa shada ritu kyawa riwa a ti wa ri meme Yahudiya ri Urushelima. Wawu nye wa wuu, riwa wa vuu kpan rikpa kponkpon konkron. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Izhi a chu wu zhu rimi vi ri tra ran nyɨme nowa to. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ama a ran henji wawu wato ran tse de wawa wa chu wa ri gbuchi, a he kita nyen, wawa ki ri kiri so iwawa, kugon riwa a wurunde ri bubu bi. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />A nota nkon riwa ki tre tre Izhi, ki ri to iri wawu nyen riwa Izhi ka bla tre wa si riwa kuu- chuwo riwo wan. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Wawu nyen wa la tre Izhi wawu wade shada rituwan ri ritu nde wan nye ndu nji riwa a kpa nyɨme riwu wa ka meme ti wan chuwo wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa No Wawa Wana To ji ran Tsitsri Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Bitrus a he rimi tre nyin, tse Wu ri Tsitsri ka gɨzhi ri nji wawa wawo iwawu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Imba nji Yahuda wawa wau Izhi, wawu nji riwa waye iwa Bitrus, waka ti mamaki to riwa hari wawa wana to ran wa nowa de ri Yuu ri Tsitsri. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Ritu riwa wawo wana tre ri nyu wari nkan, wari ran gbre Izhi imba Bitrus ka tre. <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Injo ran he riwa ari zuta rima riwa ki sonji wanyi rimmi wan ran, wawa wafe Yuu ri Tsitsri, bibi riwa kita kife ngawen?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Imba tse ka nowa son wa riima rinde Yeso Alimasiu. Imba waka bre wu no fon vi tsa sro ngan ri wawa ri.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Bitrus a la tre riwa hu Izhi ri Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Rima wandu Izhi ri miri vayi wawa wa he ri meme Yahudiya wawo ri wawa wana to Izhi ran wa kpa tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Riwa Bitrus a ye Urushelima, wawa wa fon wanju waka wan nyu. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Waka ka tre &lt;&lt;ngyen ngan wu gra ri wawa wa ran fon nju ran uba, hari wuri ri bibi iwawa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Imba Bitrus ka gbuchi, ran mɨlan ran lawa tre ran hu ritu tre ri: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Ame me he rigbu Yafa ri bre, tse ira ye rimo. Me to kya gɨzhi ri ye rimo ka ncho tsro ri ka kpa, wa tru zhu ri shu zu nju wan nza, ran ka ye rɨme. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Riwa me sro si riwu, me ya meri to wa nɨma wa ko, ri nɨma wa ji, riwa wa gban ri meme nga wa chenchen rimi mba. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />nga me wo raan ri tre rimo,&lt;Bitrus, Wurunde, han, wuri tan!&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ama me tre wu, &lt;Bachi, me ran tan ran, ritu kya riwa wana tsiri-u nga riwa wa shɨma-u ran gra nyu won zari ran.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Imba iran ka zhu rishu tre mo ri hari, &lt;Ikya riwa Izhi tsiri-u, ran tre ri wa hon tsiri-u ran.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Wati nganyi mkpa tra, gbi wu,hishu.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ba yo sron tse ga nji tra wa kɨri kusi ko riwa ki he. Wa tiwandu zhu ri kasai riya ye ri me. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Tse Yuu ka tre rimo ri nowen me hi iwawa, me ran hon yo sron ran. &lt;&lt;Imiri vayi won tanren waka kawen gon hi, hari ki ka gra rimi ko nji-a. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Imba Bitrus ka lata bibi riwa a to nji rindu Izhi a kɨri ri kowan, ran ran tre ri, &lt;Ti wandu hi Yafa nowa yo Sima riwa wayo ri Bitrus. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Wawu ri la wa tre riwa wuti wuri fe kpa chuwo ritu wan.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Riwa me gbuchi ri tre, Iyu ri Tsitsri ka gɨzhi riwa, bibi riwa a gɨzhi ritagbuci. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Imba me tika,&lt; Yohana, rima nyen a son nji rimi wan, ama biyi ri Yuu ri Tsitsri nyen bi ti riwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Tu nde Izhi nowa de bibi riwa a nota, riwa ki kpa yɨme ri tre &lt;&lt;Yeso Alimasiu, ame ngan riwa me kawon ri tre Izhi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Riwa wawo Bitrus a tre nganyi waka ka janyu chuwo wari gra gbre Izhi wari tre,&lt;&lt;Izhi kpa nyime no wawa wana kpa Izhi ran chuwo kɨma ye riwu, nga ran kpawa chuwo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa hu Izhi ri Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />To, wawa wa shan ritu yaa riwa a wurunde ritu Istifanus, wa zɨrehari ri meme Finikiya, nga kubrus ri gbu Antakiya, wana ran tre tre ji ri konjo ran ara wa nji Yauda nkankshe. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ama nji kubrus wari wa ri wa kurane rimi wawa ri ye mba ri Antakiya waka tre ri wawa wana kpa nji ran, wa ran tre tre Yeso Bachi riwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Mgbembren Bachi a he ri wa, hari nji kigbu riwa wa de sron mba wari kpa tre tre Bachi wari kɨma ye ri Bachi. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Imba itre-a ka gra riton wa tra Izhi wawa wa ri Urushelima, wa hu Izhi waka ti Banaba ndu hi ri Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Riwa waka zhu ran to dindi ti riwa Izhi a ti riwa ti kikɨlan sron ran lawa ri nowa kuki ri nkakshi wan ri sron mba wawu <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Ritu a he nji dindi riwa a sho ri Yuu ri Tsitsri ri yo sron. Tse nji kigbu waka ye kusi Izhi.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Imba Banaba ka tarsus bubu wa shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Kugon riwa a tou, ran ngɨzhi-u hi ri Antakiya Ise ri chi wa kana kabiru ri tira Izhi, wari ran tsro nji wa kɨgbumgbajiuu ran. Ri Antakiya nyen wa gbuchi yo wa hu Izhi ri krista.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ri vi mba nyen wa la tre Izhi wari waka zhu Urushelima ye ri Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Tse iri rimi mba wana yo ri Agabas, a wurunde ran tre ri gbengbren wu ri, nchon yo ri ri gra, ri mgbumgbɨru menyi wawa, watiu ri vi riwa Kaludiyas a he chu. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Imba wa hu Izhi waka yo sron riwa wa tru zon hiri miri vayi ri bibi senkpa riwa wa riwu ri meme Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ngamba nyen waka tiru wari ri sako mba hi zu riwo wa Banaba mba Shawulu hi wa rinkon tra Izhi.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Wa Wuu Yakubu Wari Tren Bitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />A he rivi nyin nye ichu Hiridus a vu wa wa wa he wau Izhi ri tasku. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Waka tsen Yakubu vayi Yohana ri nji mgban. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Riwa a to ikya riwa a si nji nji Yahuda sron, imba ran vu Bitrus ngawen. A he ri vi ri ro ri ri bi ri riwa wana ri sro mumu ri kpa kpi fu ran. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Riwa a vuu, a kau yo ri tra trenji, ran kau kabɨu iwa wa lokpa zinza son za nowa ran gben, ri rimɨren riwa wa ngɨzhi-u ye kusi wanji kugon riwa wa kɨrero. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Waka tre Bitrus ri tra trenji, wa tra Izhi waka gra bre Izhi ritu wan.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Kpa Bitrus Chuwo Ri Tɨra Tɨrenji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Ri chu riwa nde mibrekpan Hiridu ri zhu ri Bitrus nowa wuu, Bitrus ka ran kruna ri tsutsu wa lokpa hari, wa lou ri che hari, wa gben wa he rinko ran gben tra trenji. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Imba tse ga nji ri ndu Izhi a kɨri kusan wan, ikpan ri ka kɨbuu ri san, ran shɨme-u, ran tre, &lt;&lt;Wurunde, gbagbla.&gt;&gt; Imba iche ka su rega riwo wan. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Inji rindu Izhi ka tre riwu ri, &lt;&lt;Su kpi wen, wuri son tan za wen.&gt;&gt;Ka ti ka tre riwu, &lt;&lt;Ka tsro ri kakpa wen wuri hu wen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Imba ka zhu hu, a ran to ri kya riwa nji rindu Izhi ti nyi a he jaji wan ran, a yonga wawu ri ra nye. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Riwa wa vu wa gben ri gbuchi nga ri han, waka zhu ri nkon ri krefi riwa wa zu gra ri gbu, nkon-a ka bu ri tuwan. Waka zhu Riwa wa zren ban kpata ri gbu ri, mba nji rindu Izhi ka kawu don. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Riwa itu Bitrus a kɨma ye riwu, ka tre, &lt;&lt;Zizan nyen me to ri Bachi nyen tru vren ri nduwan ye, no ye kpawen chuwo riwo Hiridus, nga meme gbre nji Yahuda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Riwa a to kya riwa Izhi a ti ri wu ngamba, ran hi ko Maremu, iyi Yohana riwa wa yo ri Markusi, bubu riwa wa kabru bran, wari ran bre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Bitrus, riwa a wuru nkon trankon, nga gran ri riwa wana yo ri roda kaye riwa ari wo ko a he ngan nyen. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Riwa a wo a he Bitrus nye a ran bu nkon ran ritu a ran ti kinklan sron, ran wurutsu bru hi mi ran tre riwa ri Bitrus nye he ri nkon trankon. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Tse waka tre riwu ri, &lt;&lt;Itu wen ran he bubu riri ran.&gt;&gt; Wawu ka kawan ran lawa iri a he Bitrus wa ka tre, &lt;&lt;Ko, a he bɨzhi wan kya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Bitrus ka kawan ran ran wurunkon, riwa wa bu nkon waka to, wari sondu ran takpe. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Riwa a to ngamba ran nzu wo riwa ri nowa son ngbangbi, ran lawa bibi riwa Bachi zhu riwu ri tra trenji. nga ran tre, &lt;&lt;La wa Yakubu ri wa mirivayi kyawa wanyi.&gt;&gt; Riwa a lawa ngamba ran wulunde hi ri bubu ri. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Riwa mibrea kpan, a ran he fifi kyari nyen a wulunde ri tsutsu wa lokpa a ran, ritu tre Bitrus. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Riwa Hiridus a wa Bitrus he gyen, ran sondu ngan wa gben. ran de tre ri nowa wa wu ran wuu. A tre ngamba ran wulunde ri meme Yahudiya ran hi ri kasiriya, ran ti vi wari ri muu.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikuu Hiridusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />To, Hiridus a tifu ri nji wa Taya bran ri Sidon. Waka ye riwu ri rimɨren riri kugon riwa wa gyuru Blastus, rinkon ri ko chu, ri nyin nyen wa yo sron ritu ri mba. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Wa ri vi ri riwa wa zon tu, Hiridus a su kpi wan riwa chu, ran kuson ritu kpanchi wan riwa chu, ran tre tre ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Nji waka kpagɨro, wari ran tre&lt;&lt;Rinyi he ran Izhi, a ran he ran nji ran. <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Imba nji rindu Izhi ka wuruu ritu riwa a ran zon Izhi nde ran, imba intsu waka riu harɨ ka kuu. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Tre Izhi ka sondu ran sro nga ran shan gra gbu. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Riwa wa Banaba mba shawulu wa kɨrendu mba riwa wa nowa kugon riwa wa zhu ri Urushelima ye, waka ngɨzhi Yohana riwa wa yo ri Markusi.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Wa chu wa Banaba Mba Shawulu Wari ti wa Ndu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ri tra Izhi riwa a he ri Antakiya nji wa la tre Izhi wa nga wa tsro, wato Banaba, ri sima riwa wa yo ri shnji, ri lukiyas nji ri kurane, ri manayan riwa wa shou mba chu Hiridus, nga Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Riwa wa kɨbu mgbazhu ri Izhi, wana vu nyu. Iyu ri Tsitsri ka tre, &lt;&lt;Ka wa Banaba mba shawulu zi mo ri gran ritu ndu riwa meyo wa nowa ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Kugon riwa wa vunyu, wari bre Izhi, waka sawo wa ritu, wari selemimba.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu Izhi Wa la Tre Izhi Ri Kubrus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Wa Banaba mba Shawulu Tsitsri Yuu a ti wandu, waka hi ri salukiya, ri muu waka gra ri nvuima hi ri kabrus. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Riwa waka zhu ri Salamis, wari tre tre Izhi rimi wa tra Izhi nji Yahuda, Yohana kana dzon wa. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Kugon riwa wa gra rigbu hari wari gra ri Bafos, waka to nji rɨ riwa ari ya tsu, nji ri la tre Izhi riche, nji Yahuda, inde wan a he Yoshuwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Riwa a he mba mukaddas sarjiyas Bulus nji riwa a he ri kpantu. Imba mukaddashi a ka yo Banaba ri shawulu ritu a wa ran wo tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ama Alimas nji ri yastu-a, (Ritu rinyi nyen a he nde wan ri rɨme Helenawa), a su wa che ran wa ran kpa mukaddashina pisi. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Shawulu, riwa wa yo ri Bulus Iyu Tsitsri a shuu riwu, ka sro si ri nji ri gbugblu. <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />A tre, &lt;&lt;A wu wuhe nchon nji ri sen ji memenji ivren bɨzhi ikpanfu dindi ti iwawu wu ran ka kpanji pisi rinkon Izhi chuwo ran ko?. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Ngye nga wo Izhi he ritu wen mba, wuti nfɨyen, wuran to Izhi ran hari hi kusi tsa.&gt;&gt; Imba rika riri iwulu nga bu waka kau si, ka si wanji riwa ari ŋgɨjiu ri kpala. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Riwa nji rinkon a to kya riwa a ti, tse ka kpanyɨme, ran gra ti sisiri ri tsro Izhi riwa a tsro.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus mba Banaba ri Bisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Bulus mba Banaba ri Antakiya riwa Bisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Bulus ri wa kpan zren wan waka wurunde ri Fega ri nvu ima, wari ka zhu ri Fega, wari hi Antakiya ri meme Basidiya, chachu son vɨri mba waka gra son ri tra Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Kugon riwa wa kɨra mbe ri doka nga mbe wa la tre Izhi, warinkon tra Izhi waka ti hi ri wa, wari tre,&lt;&lt;Miri vayi, inde tre kya he riwa bi tre rnji, bi ka tre.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Tse Bulus ka wurunde, a nzuwo inowa ki mgbi, a tre ri, &lt;&lt;Biyi miri vayi nji israila, ri gbron nji ti sɨri Izhi, sɨren ton mbi! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Izhi riwa Izhi wa Israila nyi a chu wa ti wa timbu, a gbre wa nji riwa ki ran he ri meme Masar, ri gbengbren wan riwa a zhu riwa ri miwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Ise senza a vu sron ri wa rimi ji. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />nga a kɨregbunji tamgban ri meme Kaana, ran kɨma meme mba ti wa mba. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ikya nyi a ti ri mi se ŋgo nza ri seton ri.&gt;&gt;Kugon ri nyi ka lo wa chu mba riwa hari ye ri vi riwa Samuila nji ri la tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Waka ibreiri nowa lo chu iwawa, imba Izhi ka nowa Shawulu ivren Kish, nji wa gbu Benjami, hari ise senza. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Kugon riwa a chu Shawulu joo ran lo Doda no he chu mba, ran kau tsro wa ri, me fe &lt;Doda ivren Yeso nji nyen riwa me yɨmeu ngbazhi ran, riwa ari ti kya riwa me tre no ti.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Rimi gɨzhi nji nyin nyen izhi a ngɨzhi nji riwa ari kpa Israila chuwo, Yeso bibi riwa a ran ka tre zi. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kafi no Yeso no gra ndu wan, Yohana a tre tre Izhi ri nji Israila wawu nowa ka meme ti mba chuwo nowa vu wa son ima. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Riwa Yohana a ti hyure-hyureriwa a ri kɨrendu wan, ran tre,&lt;Bi ya isimbi me he ngan? A ran he ame nye wa bi gben wen ran. Ama srenton! Nji ri ri ye kugonwon, riwa ko ntan za wan me ran to siu ran.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Biyi wa ngɨzhi Ibrahi, imiri vayi, ri wawa wati sisiri Izhi rimimbi, kitan yen wa tru tre kpanji chuwo nyin. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Ngye wawa wason rimi Urushelima nga wa rinkon mba wana to tre wa ndu Izhi kɨreran, imba wana to tre riwa wa la tre Izhi hi riwa wa kra bla chachu son viri ran, wari sho tre riwa wa la tre Izhi ri vi riwa wa wuu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ko riwa wana fe ri meme ti riwa wa wuu ran, waka kamba bre Bitrus inowa wuu. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Riwa wa shu kya riwa wa ngan ritu wan, waka gɨzhi wu ritu kponkpon nkron, wari kau yo ri juju. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ama Izhi ka ta shɨme ri juju, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Ivi kigbu riwa a he ri wawa wa zhu ri Galili ye ri Urushelima, wawa zizan wa shada wan ri nji.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Kita ngawen ki ngɨzhi tre raro ye riyi, iri, alkauri riwa Izhi a ti ri wati watimbu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />A nyiwen wan rita, kita kɨe wan mba, riwa a ta Yeso shɨme ri kuu, bibi riwa wa ngan zi ri mbe zabura ri hari ri, &lt;Wu he vren won, Ame me he tiwen riwa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ritu ri ta shɨme ri kuu riwa Izhi a ti, iri ran bru hi ri meme rimi riwa ari gla ngaran, ga kya riwa a tre:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;&lt;&lt;Me yo wo ri tsitsri ri yin riwa me tre ri Doda.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ritu Zabura ri ngawen a tre:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">&lt;Wu ran yɨme no Tsitsri wen no gla.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />&lt;&lt;Doda kam, kugon riwa a tindu riwanji rinzan wan ritu nufiji, a kruna waka nno yibi riwa ti watiwan, ka gla. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ama wawu rinyi riwa Izhi ta-shɨme, a ran gla ran.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />&lt;&lt; Ritu kamba, miri vayi, tse bi ki to ri ritu nji nyi nyen wa layi ka meme timbi chuwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Zu riwo nganga, wawa wa kpa yɨme riwu wa jɨbu ritu kyawa riwa wana kpanji chuwo ri mbe riwa Musa ran. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ritu kamba bi ti rere, ran no kya riwa a he ri wa mbe wa la tre Izhi wala nofe yi, wa.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Tomba, biyi wa sho miri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">bi pisi ritu sisiri, bi ri kɨre! Ritu riwa meti ŋdu-ri rinzan bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">indu riwa ba kya riwa bi ti bi ri kpa-yɨme ko inde njo la yi.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Riwa wa Bulus mba Banaba wa zhu rimi tra Izhi, imba nji waka bre wa inowa tre tre nyi sron ngan chachu son-vɨri ri kusi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Riwa nji wa shan, nji Yahuda kigbu ri wawa wa wo nji Yahuda, wawa wau Izhi, waka hu Bulus ri Banaba, wa ka tre riwa, ri ran ŋŋoron wa nowa kuki ri ndindi ti riwa Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Riwa chachu son vɨri mba a kɨma ye, wa gbu wawu, waka ye riwa wawo tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ama nji Yahuda wawu waka to nji kigbu, wari kamba riwu branbran, wari sondu jan wu ritu kyawa wawa Bulus a tre, wari ran kɨratu.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Imba wa Bulus mba Banaba waka tre ba sisiri ri, &lt;&lt;Biyi, a bi riwa biyi nyen wari gbuchi tre tre Izhi, ama ritu riwa bi truu, bi tsro ri bi ran he riwa bi fe ki riwa a ran kre ran, to, ki kɨma hi ri wawa wana kpa Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ritu kayin, Bachi la rita, ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">&lt;Me yo wuhe kpan risi wawa wana kpa Izhi ran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">Ritu riwa ritu wen nyen nji wa fe jɨbu, hari hi ri kɨremgbumgbɨumme.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Riwa wawa wana to Izhi ran wa wo nganyi, waka ti kinklan sron, wari gbre tre Izhi. wa wa wachu wa riwa wa son riwa a ran kre ran wa kpa nyɨme.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Tre Izhi ka sondu shan ran gra ri gbu wawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ama nji Yahuda waka gyuru mba wari wawa wa hu tre Izhi, wawa wa ri daraja, nga wa gbu wari wa ri gra wa ka ka bubu kabru ri wa Bulus mba Banaba, waka zuwa ri gbu mba. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Wawa waka kpo wɨru ri za mba ritu sheda riwa, wari hi ri Ikoiya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ama wau Izhi waka sondu ti kinkilan sron bran, Iyu ri Tsitsri ka he riwa ngbazhi ran.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Isi Bulus nga Banaba Ri Ikoiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />To ri Ikoiya waka gra ri tra bre Izhi nji Yahuda iwawa, Waka la tre Izhi. Ikpa nji, nji Yahuda nga wawa wa ran to Izhi ran, waka kpanyɨme. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ama nji Yahuda riwa wa kamba ri hu, waka gyuru wawa wa ran hu Izhi ran, wari kpawa pisi nowa ran kpa Izhi ran. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />nga Bulus mba Banaba wa ki bi ran ri bubu wa, wari ran la tre Izhi ri sron riri ritu ikon Bachi wawu nyen a la tre dindi ti wan riwa ari no wa ngbemgbren kya wa dindi hu ri wo mba. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ama nji wa gbu waka ga kamba, wari kɨma hi ri kugon nji Yahuda wari ka hi kugon wa ndu Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Riwa wawa wa ran hu Izhi nga nji Yahuda nga wa rinkon mba, wa wulu riwa ri fu riwa hu Izhi nowa ya bi ran wari tawa ri tita. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Waka wo labari , wari tsutsu hi ri gbu likoniya wato listira nga Darba, nga ran kagon mba. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Ri ŋba waka ran la tre Izhi. Is wa ta Bulus ri tita ri listira.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a bla tre Izhi ri Listira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />To ri listira nji ri ka kuson, idza wan wa ran senkpa-ran, a ran ti kpɨre ran tu ri vi riwa wa ngɨzhi wu, a ran zren to ran. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ka ran wo la tre Izhi Bulus, mba Bulus ka yo si riwu, riwa a to ri ikpa nyɨme wen wa tsra riwa wa no-u fe si. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Ka nzu ran ran tre,&lt;&lt;Wulunde, kiri rinde.&gt;&gt; Mba nji-a za kiri rinde ran zren. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Riwa igbunji-a waka to kya riwa Bulus a ti, waka nzu ran gbangban wari ran tre ri rɨme Likoniya, &lt;&lt;Njanji, izhi wa tsitsa wa gra rita ri bibi kpa mbu nji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Waka tre ri Banaba wawu he zafsa, nga Bulus ritu wawu ŋgen he rinkon ri tre, ri wawu nyen he Hamisa. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mba ichu wa ti baan Zeyus, riwa itranga wan a he ri kugon gbu, ka ngɨzhi nchon lando nga flawa ri nkon gbu, ka ran su ran ti hadaya wawa igi.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ama riwa wa ndu Izhi-a Banaba nga Bulus, ran wo kamba, waka zhu tsro nba gbon wari ran kpagiro hi gra rimi gbunji wa ran tre. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Ritu ŋge ko bi ti kamba? Kita ngawan ki he nji ka biyi ki ngɨzhi tre Izhi nyen ye ri yi, ritu bi ri kɨmagon ti Izhi wa ari vɨri, riwa a ti shu ran ti meme nga kya riwa a he ri miwan. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Wawu nyen ri zamaniwa riwa a ka wawu nji don ri nowa ti kyariwa wa su. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ri kamba a ran ka ngawan chuwo zari to ran, a ran lawanjo ritu a ri ti kya dindi ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Ri bibi tre wamba ama wa ran to kiri gbengben wari nowa ran ti hadaya-a ran ritu mba.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ama nji Yahuda wari waka zhu ri Antakiya nga Ikoiya, riwa wa kpa kabru nji pisi, wari chu Bulus ri tita wari gbi wu hi kugon gbu, wari yonga a kuu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ama riwa wa hu Izhi waka kagon wan ki, ka wurunde ran kɨma hi ri gbu ri mibrerɨa wan wawu mba Banaba waka hi Darba.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bru ye ri Antakiya rimi Suriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Riwa wa la tre ji ri gbu, wakafe wa hu ji bi ran, waka kɨma hi listira nga ikoniya, nga Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wari ran karfafa wa hu Izhi, wari ran fen waton riwa nowa kri ri yosron mba, wari ran tre ara ri shaya bran ko ki gra ri kpanchison Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Kugon riwa wa zhu wa rinkon riwa ri kowan ikkelisiya, nga ri bre Izhi vu wu, wari kawa no Bachi, wawa na kpanyɨme riwu. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Riwa wa zren rimi gbu Bisidiya, wari ka zhu ri meme Bamfiliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />riwa wa la tre-a ri Fega waka hi ri Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Ri bubu wan mba waka gra rimi nvu ima hi ri Antakiya, ri bubu riwa towo riwa wa bre Izhi riwa no dindi ti Izhi no he riwa rimi ndu riwa zizan wa kɨrewu. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Riwa wa ke, waka vu nji wa hu Izhi wari ran lawa ikya riwa Izhi, ti ritumba, nga bibi riwa ka bu nkon ri wawa wa ran to Izhi ran nkon. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Waka ban vi ri bubu wan iwa mirindu Izhi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Shutu kabru ri Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Nji wa ri wa ka zhu ri Yahudiya ran ye ri Antakiya wa ran tsro miri vayi:&lt;&lt;Bi ran fon nju ka bibi riwa Musa a tsro ran wa kpa yi chuwo ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Ritu tre nyi wa Bulus mba Banaba waka janyu ri ngamba. Waka chu wa Bulus mba Banaba nga wari wawa wa kpa Izhi, no wa hi Jerusalem ri fe wandu Izhi ri wa rinkon ritu tre nyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Wa hu Izhi wa ka ngɨzhi wa ti kon, wa ka zu ri gbu Finikiya nga Samariya, wa ka ran la tre sran meme ti mba ri wawa wa ran kpa ran, tre nyi ka no miri vayi wa ka ngɨri ri tre-a. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Riwa wa ye ri Urushelima, wa hu Jii nga mirindu Izhi, ri wawa wa la ko ngye ritu kya riwa Izhi ti zu riwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Nga wa hu Izhi wawa wa he iwa Farisa wa wurunde wari tre,&lt;&lt;Wa wa ran kpa Izhi ran dole wa fon wa nju wari no wa hu doka Musa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Mba wa ndu Izhi nga wa rikon wa ka shu tu ki wa ri kpa tre-a. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Kugon riwa wa tre tre-a Bitrus ka wurunde ran tre riwa:&lt;&lt;Miri vayi, bi to ri rivi mu Izhi a chu wen rimi mbi ari wawa wa ran to Izhi ran wa wo tre Izhi ri nyu won wari kpa. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Izhi, riwa a to sron ko nga, a tsro ri wa wu nyɨme wa, bibi riwa a ti rita. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />A ran ga ta ti nkan-nkan riwa ran, a ngɨla sron mba ri tu kpa nyɨme. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Zizan nganyi, ngye ti ko bi wa bi ri tsra Izhi riwa bi no wandu Izhi ya riwa ko kita ko wa ti watimbu ki vu sron wu? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Onhon, ki kpa nyɨme ritu ndindi ti Bachi mbu Yeso nye wa kpata chuwo, bibi riwa wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ibgu nji wa ka son ŋgbi, wa ri ran wo Banaba nga Bulus, riwa Izhi a ti ri tsutsu wawa wa ran to Izhi zu riwo mba. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Riwa wa kɨre, Yakubu ka tre:&lt;&lt;Miri vayi, wo wen. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Bitrus a la ta bibi riwa ri chu wari rimi wawa wa ran kpa Izhi ran nowa he wama. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Wa la tre Izhi wa kpa nyɨme ri nga nyi:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Kugon ri nyi ame Bachi me bru ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">me ri bru me ko riwa Doda riwa a dzi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">me bru me kankan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">me ri no kɨri nde,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Riwa ngbɨron nji wawu wa wa Bachi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">wawa wana kpa Izhi ran iwawu riwa me yowa nowa he wamon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Ame Bachi me tre nganyi&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Riwa me tre zi mgbamgbanmu.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />&lt;&lt;A he bla tre won, nganyi, ki ran no noe riya ri wawa wa wa wari kɨma ye ri Izhi ran. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ritu nganyi ki nga riwa no wa kɨma gon ti meme la riwa Izhi mba, nga kru mba ntran, rimi nɨma riwa wa mawato wuu nga yii. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Sisenmu, bla gbu wa wa wa bla tre ri mbe Musa, wa ran kɨra tre-a ri tre Izhi chachu son vɨri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa rinkon tra Izhi riwa wati wa ndu ri wawa wa ran kpa Izhi ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Imba wa mirindu Izhi riwa rinkon, nga wa hu Izhi wawu, wa chu rimi wa nji mba wari ti wandu hi ri Antakiya ri Bulus mba Banaba. Waka chu Yauza riwa wa yo ri Basaba, nga Sila, wawa wa he wa rinkon rimi miri vayi. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Riwa wa tiwa ndu ri mbe nyi: &lt;&lt;Wa ti ndu Izhi nga wa rinkon, imiri vayi mbi, miri vayi, Wawa wa hu Izhi ri Antakiya, Suriya, nga Kilikiya ran: Me chi yi. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Riwa ki wo ri wari mbu wa ran zhu ri to mbu ran wari nga yi, kpa sron mbi ran time kya riwa wa tre. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ki nyɨme wawu mbu ki chu nji wari kiri ti wa ndu ri yi riwa kpa wa Banaba nga Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />nji ri wa wa katu mba reritu nde Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ngye ki ti wa Yauza nga Sila ndu nowa layi kyawa wa nyi ri ritu mba: <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />A bi riwa Iyu Tsitsri ri kita nota ki ran noyi ya nga kyawa riwa wa he janji, wato: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Kɨma gon ti kya riwa wa han ri Izhi mba, ritu itan nɨma ri yiyii, ri tan kya riwa wa maato, ri tin tra.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:29">Bi kpa tre wa nyi bi son ri sikpa.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Wa ka no nji hi ngamba, waka hi Antakiya, bubu riwa wa fe nji wa hu Izhi wa ki wari ka mbe-a no wa. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Nji wa ka kra mbe-a wa ri ngɨri ritu anowa senkpa. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yauza nga Sila, riwa wa he wa la tre Izhi, wa tre kigbu riwa a no miri vayi mba gbengbren. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Kugon riwa wa wuvi ri bubu wan, imiri vayi mba wa ka nowa hi ngamba, ri tilu nga si sron nowa bru hi riwa wa wa wati wa ndu. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ama Sila a to a bi riwa a ri son ri bubu wan. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Bulus nga Banaba wa ki Anatakiya, wawa nga nji wa tsro wa dɨbu tre Bachi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijannyu ri tsutsu wa Bulus mba Banaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Chachu ri Bulus ka tre ri Banaba,&lt;&lt;Ki bru hi ki ri to mirivayi ri gbu wawu bubu wa ki bla tre Bachi ki ri to bibi riwa wa ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Banaba a wa ran ban Yohana, ri wa wa yo wu ri Markus ngawen, riwa, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ama Bulus ka taka a ran bi riwa wa ban wu ran, ritu a ka wa chuwo ri Famfiliya, ran ka wan ri ti ndu riwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Waka ka ngamba chuwo rimi fu. Banaba ka ban Markus wa ri ka gra ri nvun ima hi Kabrus. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ama Bulus ka ban Sila, kugon riwa wa mirivayi wa bre Izhi dindi ti Izhi no hu, no hi. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ka hi Suriya nga Kilikiya, ran no wa tre ri sen kpa.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti a hu Bulus mba Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Bulus a ye ri Darba nga Listira, ivren ndu Izhi riwa wa yo Timoti a he, iyi wan a he vɨra Yahudiya iwa ri hu Izhi, ama A ti wan a he nji Helenawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Miri vayi ri Listira nga Ikoiya wa tre dindi ritu Timoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Bulus a wa ran ban wu hi bubu zren, riwa ari fon nju ritu nji Yahuda wawa wa he bubu wan, don wato iri ati wan he nji Helene nye. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Wa ka zren hu ri gbu ri gbu, wa ka ran la nji tre riwa wa ndu nji riwa wa rikon wa hu Izhi ri Urushelima wa ka zi riwa wa ran hu. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Wa hu Izhi waka fe senkpa rimi kpa nyime, ri vi ri vi wa ka ran fe nji branbran.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyakusi Bulus nga nji ri Makidoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bulus ri wakpan zren wan wa ka hi meme Firijiya nga Galatiya, mba Tsitsri Yuu ka ran no wa nkon tre tre Bachi ri meme Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Riwa wa ka ye ri dren meme Misiya, wa ka wa wari gra meme Bitiniya, ama isron Yeso a ran nyɨme wa ran. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Wa ka hu meme Misiya, wa ri ka gɨzhi hi Taruwasa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Ivi ri ri chu Bulus ka to tre a ye riwu ritu nji Makidoniya a kri nga ran ran bre wu, &lt;&lt;Ye ri makidoniya ri zon ta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Riwa tre Izhi a ye ri Bulus waka chu gbla riwa wa hi Makidoniya, wa ri to a he njajin nye Izhi yo ta ki tre tre wan riwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiya a kpa nyɨme Filibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Imba kika gra nvu ima ri Taruwasa, ki ri ban nkon hi ri meme Samutaraki, ri mibreri han wan ki ka gra ri Niyabolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Mba ki ka hi Filibi ri meme Makidoniya, riwa a he nchon gbu ri bubu wan, igbu nyi a he gbu Romawa nye. Ki ri bubu wan bran.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Chachu sonvɨri ki ka hi nkon gbu, ki ri hi nyu ba, ki yo nga bubu ri bre Izhi he. Imba ki ka ku ki, ki ri tre ri mba wawa wa kabru. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Iri rimi wawa wa ran wo tre mbu, nde wan a he Lediya, a ran reri tsro, ri gbu Tayatira, a ran hu Izhi. Bachi ka bu sron wan ran wo tre Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Wawu ri wako wan wa ka son wa ri ima, ka ibreta ri,&lt;&lt;Riwa bi kpa nyɨme ri me ri me kpa nyɨme ri Bachi, ye bi ri son ri ko won.&gt;&gt; Imba ka kɨma sron mbu ye ri ngawan.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus mba Sila rimi tra tre nji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ivi ri ki ran hi bubu bre Izhi, ki ka to vɨra ko riwa a he ri bɨzhi riwa ari ya tsu, a ran ngɨzhi fe kyawa ki gbu ran no nji riko wan ritu ya tsu-a. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ka ran hu Sila, nga Bulus, ka ran kpa gro ran ran tre ri,&lt;&lt; Nji wa nyi wa he wa ndu Izhi riwa wa gbresan wan nye, wa la yi nkon riwa ari kpa yi chuwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />A ran ti ngamba rivi-rivi, Bulus ka ti fu bran, ran tre ri bɨzhi, &lt;&lt;Me la wu rimi nde Yeso kristo, ka-u chuwo! &gt;&gt; Mba ka kawu chuwo gbagbla.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Wa nji wawa wa he ri tsɨren vɨra ri komba riwa wa fe nkon nkɨren zu riwo wan a ka wari vu wa Bulus mba Sila, wari vu wa hi ri nyu ri chu kusi wa bla tre. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Wa ngɨzhii wa ye kusi wa bla tre wa ri tre, &lt;&lt;Nji wa nyin wa he nji Yahuda, wa kpa gbu mbu ri ti me. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wa tsro ta bibi ti riwa a ran bi riwa ki kpa ko ki hu ran, riwa kita ki he nji Yahuda nye. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Imba ikpa nji wa ka zhu wa wu, wari tsi Bulus mba Sila, wa bla tre wa ka tre i no wa zhu tsro mba wari tsi wa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Riwa wa ka tsi wa, wa ka yo wa ri tra wa tre, wa la wa tre no yo wa rimin tra tre. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Riwa a kpa tre ri de senkpa ran kawa sro ri mimmi tra ri trenji, ran lowa ri mkpon kron ri kpre.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ri tsutsu chu Bulus mba Sila wa ran ibrewari ran chuse ri gbre nde Izhi, wawa wa tre wa waka ran sɨren ton ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ri kari meme ka chu ka hu nchi tra riwa wa trenji ngawen ka chu. Mba nkon tra wan wa ka bu nga che wawa wa tre wa waka su. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Wa nji wa gben wa tre ka shime, ran to nkon tra riwa wa tre nji wa kaki ri huwo, ka chu nji mgban wan, ran ran wa ran wuu ngawan, a yonga wawa wa tre wa wa wurutsu. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ama Bulus ka kpa gro, &lt;&lt;Ran wuu ngawen ran, ki he wawu mbu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Nji riwa a riya wawa wa tre wa ka yo wuru, ran gra ran joku kusi wa Bulus mba Sila. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Imba ka ngɨzhi wa ye ra ran miyen wa,&lt;&lt; Biyi wa rinkon, me tise ko me ri fe jɨwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Wawa waka tre, &lt;&lt;Kpa nyɨme ri Bachi Yeso, wu jɨwu biyi wa wako wen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Imba wa Bulus mba Sila waka la wu tre Bachi wawu ri wa ko wawu. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ri chu mba nji ri ya wa tre nji ka vu wa zhu ra ran ngɨla kpan njon mba; imba wa wu ri nji wa ko wan wa son wa ri ima. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Nji riwa ari ya wawa wa tre wa ka ngɨzhi wa ye ko wan ran no wa la, ka ngɨri bran ritu riwa wa a kpa ŋyme ri Izhi riwa nji wa ko wan wawu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Riwa mibrea kpan, rinkon wa lo nji ka ti mirindu wan ri gbengbren wan ran tre:&lt;&lt;Juu nji wa mba chuwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Nji ri ya wa tre nji ka la Bulus, &lt;&lt; A wu nga Sila iri ki si yi chuwo. Zizan hi ngambi. Hi ri si sron.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ama Bulus ka tre ri mirindu nji ri bla tre:&gt;&gt; Wa tsi ta ri si kpa nji, wana ŋɨma ta ran ko riwa ki he Romawa bi ri yo ta ri tra tre! Zizan wa wa wari ka ta chuwo ri yayibi? Tsede nowa ye kyumba wa ri zhu ri ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Imba mirindu nji ri bla tre waka la nji ri ko mba tre-a, riwa wa wo ri Bulus mba Sila wa he Romawa, waka ti sisɨri. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Imba imrirko nji ri bla tre waka hi wari ka bre wa wari zhu riwa rimi tra tre nji wari tre inowa ka gbu don. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Riwa Bulus nga Silas wa zhu ri tra tre, wa ka hi ko Lidiya, wa ka to miri vayi mba wa ri nowa tre ri sen kpa. wari hi ngamba.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Bulus mba Sila ri Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Riwa wa zu hi Amfilolis nga Aboloniya, wa ye ri Tasalonika bubu riwa itra Izhi nji Yahuda a he. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Bibi riwa Bulus ri si ti chachu , ka gra ri tra Izhi, a ti vi tra rimi sati tra ran ran jannyu riwa ri mi tre wa mbe. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Bitrus ka ran la wa janji tre, iri kristo ri so ya ran wurunde ran bru tre riwa,&lt;&lt;Yeso ri wa me layi tre wan wawu nye he Bachi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wa ri mba wa ka nyime, wa ri ka hu Bulus mba Sila, ngamba ikpa nji Helenawa riwa wa ti sisiri Izhi nga mba kigbu.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ama nji Yahuda wa ka tingu ritu wa wa nji Yahuda riwa wa ka sro mba no wa Bulus mba Sila; wa ka vu nji wa tingungu wari ran wanyu rimi gbu. Waka wurutsu gra riko Yason, wari ran wa Sila mba Bulus riwa wa zhu riwa kusi nji wa wanyu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ama riwa wa ran fe wa ran, wa ka gbi Yason nga miri vayi wa ri kusi wa rinkon, ran kpa gro:&gt;&gt; Nji wa nyi riwa wa kpa mgbumgbulu me time wa ye ri nyi, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />nga Yason a kpa wa ye ko wan. Wawu mba wa kpa doka nchon chu riwa wa yo-u ri Kaisar time, wa ri ri tre ri ichu ri he, ri wa yo Yeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Riwa wa wo gbu iwa wa bla tre wa wo rinyi isro mba ka wurunde. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Imba wa ka no Yason nga ngbɨron nji no wa han ko wari kpa wo mba no wa hi ngamba.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus mba Sila ri Biriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Riwa ichu a ti, miri vayi waka tru wa Bulus mba Sila hi ri Biriya. Riwa waka zhu ri bubu wan, wa ka hi tra Izhi ri Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Wa nji Yahuda wanyi, wa han wanji Tasalonika ri sron riwa warinkon, ritu wa kpa tre-a wo hari, wa sondu kra wamba bla vi, ritu nowa to ka a he nganyi nye. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Riru nganba nji kigbu rimi nji Yahuda waka kpa nyɨme, ri Helenawa wana he tsawen ran imba wa wa wa wan si nga ronron mba.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ama riwa nji Yahuda wa Tasalonika wa wo iri Bulus ri la tre Izhi ri Biriya ngawen, waka hi wari ka gyuru kpanji ri mu, wari ran kpa sron mba ran time. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Imba nye imiri vayi waka tru Bulus hi ri nyu ima Ba, ama wa Sila mba Timoti waka ki ri bubu wan. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Wawa wa ngɨzhi Bulus ye tin nkon, ste nde wa ngɨzhi wu ka zhu ri Atina kugon riwa Bulus a nowa doka nowa la Sila mba Timoti, iri nowa ye ri wawu gbagbla, waka hi.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ri gbu Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Riwa Bulus a ran gben wa ri Atina, a ti fu riwa a wa rinkon wawa wa ran hu Izhi ran wa shu gbu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Waka ki si tanjo tre rimi nga nji Helenwa wawa wa hu Izhi, nga nji wawa a kabru ri wa ri nyu richu. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Vren ye ruwa Abikuriya wa ri si to kya wari wawa wa kpan tu waka ye kabru,&lt;&lt;Nji riwa ari tre nyi ri tre se?&gt;&gt;Wari wa ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ki ya a he nji riwa ari tre tre shnji zhi.&gt;&gt;Ritu riwa a tre ri wawu ri tre tre Yeso nga ta shɨme rimi kuu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Imba waka ngji-u hi ri kusi warinkon gbu Arasa wari miye-u ri,&lt;&lt;Ka wu lata bibi tsro tre ritan nye riwa wu tsro? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ritu wu ngɨzhi kya riwa wa sisa ri ye rita, kita kiwa kiri to bibi wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Ritu wa nji Atina wawu ri wa tsitsri mba wa wa kya riwa ran wo wa ri ran tu, wu vi mba rimi wo tre ri sisa ko ka kya riwa a ye hyureriwu.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Imba Bitrus ka wurunde kri kusi wa rinkon gbu Arasa, ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;biyi wanji Atina, me ya bi wa hu zhi wa ti bran bran bla nkon. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ritu riwa mesi kagbamu, me ya bibi ti ri hu Izhi hari meri fe bubu kri ri bla tre riwa wa tsiri-u ri ngaan nyi ritu wan ri,&lt;To, wawu riwa bi hu ama bi ran to-u ran, wawu nye me la yi. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Izhi riwa a ti me ri kyawa riwa wa rimi wan a he Bachi ri shu nga ri me tra ibrerwa nji me ran. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Nga a ran ri wa zon ri wo njo ran, Ari wan gye riwo ngaan, riwa ide wawu nye ri de vɨri nga kyawa wawu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Wawu nye a ngiji kpa nji rimi nji riri ritu nowa ki ri mgbumgburu me, ra nowa ki ri dren ri dren meme mba, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Ritu tre wan he iri nowa don ka wa wa wu ka wa ka fe wawu ama a ran he kpata ri iri mbu ran. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ritu riwa,&lt;&lt;A he ritu wan nye ko ki viri, ki chu kiri he,&gt;Bibi riwa wa chuse mbi wa tre,&lt;Kpunji tre, kita ngawen ki he gɨzhi wan nye.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />&lt;&lt; Ritu riwa ki he miri Izhi, a ran bi riwa ki yonga ba ri Izhi zhu kyawa wawa wa bi ri meme nyi ran, ka kyawa wa kpa rirri ka tila ran kariwa nji ti ri wiwiri wan ran. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Sisenmu, a ran ya ta ri kpɨra ka nji wana kpa rina ama zizan ari de nyu iri noji wawu ko kutan nowa ka meme ti mba chuwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />A ka vi zi riwa ari bla tre ri kpanji wan ri mgbumgburu me nyi zu riwo nji riwa a chu Yeso tsro ta rinyi ritu riwa a ta shɨme ri juju!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Riwa wa wo Bulus a tre ritu ta shɨme ri juju, wari mba waka nza-u ama wari waka tre,&lt;&lt;Ki wa kiri bru wo-u nobru tre bibi tre nyi nganga. <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Nga Bitrus ka ka bubu kabru tu-a don. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Wari waka kpa nyɨme wari hu, rimi mba ri wa wana yo ri Diyonisiyas, a he rimi warinkon ritu mgburu Asara, iwa ri ngawen a he riwa wana yo-u ri Damaris ri gbron nji wari.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Bulus Ri Koranti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Mba, Bulus ka wurunde ri Atina ran hi Koranti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Mba ka to nji Yahuda riwa wa yo Akila, asalin wan a he nji Fantas, a ran son bran bran ri ye ri meme Italiya ran, riwa iwa wan Briskila, i ri kalaudiyas a la nji Yahuda no ka Roma chu wo. Mba Bulus ka hi ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />A he nji ri ti bru to ka wa wa nga wen, ka son ran tindu ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Ri vi ri sonvɨri a ran la wa tre ri tra Izhi, ran ran rinjayar nji Yahuda nga wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Riwa wa Sila mba Timoti wa ka ye ri Makidoniya, Bulus ka ran bla tre Izhi, ka ran la nji Yahuda ri Yeso he kristo. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ama riwa nji Yahuda wa kamba ri Bulus nga wari si kra tu, ka chu tsro wan ran tre wa &lt;&lt;Alaki mbi a he ri to mbi! A me mi zhu, me hi ri wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />A wurunde ran hi ko nji ri riwa nde wan a he Titus Yustus nji dindi, ko wan a he huehyureri tra Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Mba kirisbus, rikon tra Izhi ka nyɨme ri Bachi, wawu ri nji wa ko wan wa wu. Korantiyawa branbran wa ka wo tra Bulus wa ri kpa nyɨme, wa ka son wa tu ri ima. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Ri chu chachu ri Bachi ka tre ri Bulus rimi raa; Ran ti sisɨri ran, ran tre tre ran son gben ran. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Me he ri wu, njo ran ti wu kya ran, me he ri nji kigbu rimi gbu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Bulus ka son tse ri ri ngbɨron, ran ri bla tre Izhi ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ama ri vi riwa Galiyo a he chu Akaya, nji Yahuda wa ka wa-u tasar ri Bulus wa ri tra bla tre. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Wa ka tre nji nyi a ri kɨma nji gbugblu no wa hu Izhi bibi riwa ibla tre a ran he ri kon ran.<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Ama riwa Bulus a bu nyu ri tre, Galiyo ka tre ri nji Yahuda, &lt;&lt;I bi yi nji Yahuda, me ti kya meme ri yi, riwa me wo tre mbi. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ama ri tre riwa bi wab wen ri tu kalmomiri nde, nga ibla tre mbi, bi ka to kya mba kyu mbi me ran he ri kon bla bibi tre mba ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ka zu wa ri tra bla tre. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Wa ka vu Sastanisu ichu tra bla tre wa ri tsi kusi tra bla tre. Ama Galiyo ka ran ti kya ri tu wan ran.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Briskila, Akila nga Afolos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Bulus ka son ri Korintiya tivi bran. riwa a ka miri vayi don ran hi ri mvu ima ri Suriya, ri Briskila nga Akila wa he ri wu. Ka kron mvu tu wan ri kankiriya ritu a ti waadi ri tu nga wan. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wa kaye zhu ri Afisa, imba Bulus ka ka Briskila nga Akila chuwo. Ama wa wu ri tu wan ka gra ri tra Izhi ra ran bla tre Izhi ri nji Yahuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Waka ibreu no bru son ri wa, ka ran nyɨme ran. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Mba ka hi nga wan, ran tre &lt;&lt;Me bru ye i Bachi kpa nyɨme rimo.&gt;&gt;Ran wulunde ri Afisa. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Riwa a zhu ri Kaisariya, a hi ran tre riwa hu Izhi nga ran ka hi ri Antakiya. Izren ri tre tre Izhi.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Riwa son bran ri Antakiya, Bulus ka hi bubu nkan-nkan ri meme Galatiya nga Firijiya, ran ran no miri ndu Izhi tre sen kpa.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Nji ri riwa a he nji Yahuda riwa nde wan a he Apolo, a he nji Alekzanda, a ye ri Afisa. A he nji riwa a to mbe Izhi branbran. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Wa tre wu ri nkon Bachi, nga ran tre bran nga wa ri tsro ritu Yeso, ama a to sontuima riwa Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />A gbuchi tre gbangban ri tra Izhi. Mba Briskila nga Akila, wa ka wo wu, wari ngɨzhi wu ye ko mba wa ri bru mɨlan la wu tre Izhi.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Riwa Apolo a nyɨme ran hi ri Akaya, miri vayi wa no wa senkpa wari ngan mbe no miri ndu Izhi no wa kpa riwa a ka zhu, a zon wa wa ka kpa nyɨme ri Bachi branbran. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ritu janyu riwa wa jan iwa wa ka tre ri sen kpa ran tsro nji Yahuda, a ran la wa tre iri Yeso a he Kisito.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Bitrus ri gbu Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Riwa Apolo a he ri korintiya Bulus a zren hu wa tu mgburu ran ka zhu ri Afisa ri bubu wan nye a fe miri wandu Izhi <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />ran miye wa ri,&lt;&lt;Bi kpa Tsitsri Yuu rivi riwa bi kpa nyɨme ri Izhi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">&lt;&lt;Kiran wo zari iri Iyu Taitsiri he ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Bitrus ka mɨye wa ri,&lt;&lt;Ko mbaron, bibi sontu ri tan nye bi kpa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">&lt;&lt; Waka kpa nyme ri,&gt;&gt;Isontu ma riwa Yohana a tre ritu wan.<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Bulus ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Isontu ma riwa Yohana he bibi riwa wa ka meme ti mba chuwo, nga ran lanji wa Israila iri nowa kpa nyɨme ri nji riwa ari ye kugon wawu wawunji-a he Yeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Riwa nji wawo nganyi, wari sontu ma rimi nde Bachi Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Bulus ka sa wa wo ritu nga Yuu Tsitiri ka gɨzhi ritu mba waka tre tre ri rɨwe kankan he sisa wari ran la tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Wa nji wuru don hari iwawu.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Bulus a gra ri tra Izhi ran ti huwa tra riwa a ran lanji ba sisiri, a ran iwawa ran ran wa ran kɨma sron ba ye ri ngawan ritu kpanchison riwa Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ama wamba waka ka wo wari kamba ri kpa nyɨme wari ran tre meme tre kusi wa nji ritu nkon ndindi riwa Bachi. Bulus ka vu wawa wa kpa nyɨme hu ngawan ran ka wawa wa kamba don, nga bla vi a ran son ran tre iwawa rimi tra ri tsro riwa tiranas. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ikya nyi a he nganyi ti se hari, ritu riwa nji wawu wawa wason ri meme Asiya, ri nji Yahuda nga wawa wana to Izhi ran wa wo tre Bachi.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Izhi a ran ti kyawa wa de sisiri riwo Bulus riwa wana tiwa zari ran. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Ko vi ŋɨma tsro riwo nga tsro wan risu riwa a suu zaari inde wa ngɨzhi hi riwa lilo, kpunji ari zu lilo joo wa rikpa nga meme bɨzhi ri zhu riwa kpa.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Nji Yahuda wari wa wa wa zren kagon wa ri ran zu bɨzhi ra zhu wana wa wari tindu ri nde Yeso riwa wati ndu nyi wa tre ri meme bɨzhi ri,&lt;&lt;Me zu yi rimi nde Yeso riwa Bulus ri tre tre wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Imiri vayi tamgban, wawa wa he rinkon wa ndu ri tra Izhi riwa wa yo ri Siba a ran ti rinyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ama me bɨzhi ka tireriwa ri,&lt;&lt;Me to Yeso, nga me to Bulus, ama a wu wu he ngaan?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Inji riwa a he ri bɨzhi meme ringawan yi ran han gbengbren mba wawu. Waka zhu wuru tsu ri ko wan, wa fon kpa itsro mba ka gbon.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Riwa nji Yahuda nga wawa wana hu Izhi ran iwawu, wawa wa son ri Afisa wa wo tre nyi, sisiri ka ti wa iwawu wari gbresan nde Bachi Yeso bran bran. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Ikpa nji wawa wa kpa Izhi wa ye ri si wari ran ngaran meme kya riwa wa ti. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Iki gbu wawa wara kpa Izhi ran waka vuwa gbugblu mba ye kabru wari huu wa kusi nji wa fon remba waa sro ngaan, iremba ka kabru jɨbo se ton. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Rimi nkon wa mgben gbengbren yi iwulo tre Bachi ka shan ran bran.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Kugou riwa kyawa wanyi wati, Bulus a yo sron wan riwa ari hi zren ri gbu makidonya nga Akaya ran hi Jerusale.&lt;&lt;Ku gon riwa me hi ri bubu wan,&gt;&gt;A tire,&lt;&lt;Dole meto Roma ngawen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Imba kati Timoti mba Arastas, wa kpan ndu wan hari-a hi ri makidoniya riwa wawu ri wuu vi tsa ri meme Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifu rimi gbu Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />A he rimi vinyi nye ifu kae ri gbu Afisa bran bran ritu tre Bachi. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Inji ri la zinariya ran kɨma wu ran ti Izhi mba riwa wara yo-u ri Damitiriyas, ran ngɨzhi ran ye tra Izhi riwa Artimas nga azurfa nga ndu wan ka ngɨzhi riba kpokpolo ye nowa ndu. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Inba ka yowa wa ri bibi ndu nyi ran tre riwa,&lt;&lt;Wa nji bi to wo mbu zhu rimi ndu nyi nye. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Zizan, bi to bi ri wo kyumbi, ikya riwa Bulus nyi ri ti A tre ri Izhi wawa wa tiwa riwo wana he Izhi ran hari a ti ran kɨma nji ye ringawan ri Afisa nga ran riwa ari kma meme Asiya wawu. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Mɨlan ya yi iya he kusimbu, a ran ritu reri kusimbu ri kankshe nye riwa ari fe ya ran hari ri tre Izhi riwa Artimas ri gra ran he kya ri ran hari wa ga wu ri shisha bi wan, wawu ri meme Asiya a wu, tiari mgbumgburu me iwawu wa kɨbu mgbazhu ri wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Riwa wawo nganyi wari gra tifu mgba Izhi ran wari ran kpagro ri,&lt;&lt;Imkpen he wame a wu yibi mba mbu ri Afisa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Imba igbu wawu ka vu wuru wanji waka vu wa Gayus zeren Bulus riwa wa zhu ri makidoniya, wari chegbla gra rimi mpuwan. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bulus a wa ran hi kusi wanji ama imiri kon ndu wan wana nyɨme noi ran. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Ko warinkon wari wa bubu wan, wa kpan Bulus, wa tindu hi riwu iri no ran nyɨme ran gra ri mpuwan ran.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Wanji wanba waka wa kya riwa wati igyen wari wana kpagro ritu kyari nga wari wana ti ritu kyari nji kigbu wana to kya riwa anowa he ri bubu wan ran. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Riwa nji Yahuda waka tre iskandari hi kusi, nga wanji wari waka kpagro lau tre iskandari ka nzu wo ran tri iri nowa ki mgbi no wawu no lawa tre. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ama riwa wa to ri a he nji Yahuda, wari nzu ran ri awa hari wari ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;Imkpen wan he wawu Artimas ri Afisa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Riwa nji ri ngaan a nowa sisron ran tre,&lt;&lt;Biyi wanji Afisa! Inji ritan nye riwa a ran to ri igbu Afisa nye wa ya tra Izhi ri gra ri Artimas ran nga tita riwa a zhu ri shu ku ri meme? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Tu nde kpunji tre nyi ran he kya riwa wa tron ran ki ri mgbamgbi ran ti kyari jiji ran. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Bi ngɨzhi nji wanyi ye ri wa-e riwa ide wana yibi kyari ri tra ri bubu bre ran ka wa kpan de Izhi mbu time ran. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />To nde Damitiriyas ri wa kpan wan wa he ri tre ritu nji ri, ga tra ri bla tre wa ye ngɨzhi wa hi. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ama nde ikyari nkan nye bi wa to tse ki ka mɨlan wuti ri bubu son ri shutu mbu kabru. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kpunji tre ki he rimi yaa riwa ki ritu kya wa wawa wa hizizan, riwa ide kita kiran to tre kya ritu fu riwa a wurund nyi ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Riwa a lawa nganyi ran kawa chuwo.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a Bru hi ri Makidoniya nga Hellas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Mba riwa ikpagro-a ka ti si, Bulus ka yo wa miri ndu, ran no wa tre sen kpa, ran bru hi meme Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Riwa Bulus a zren ri gbu ri gbu mba, ran ri la wa tre sen kpa nga ran bru ye meme Hellas. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />A son ti hua tra, nji Yahuda wa ka lo zi ri sron mba ritu wan ka a ran hi ri nvu ima ri meme suriya, a ka zi ri sron ri wawu ri bru ye ri meme makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Wa subataras, ivren Bulus, ka ngɨzhi-u ti nkon, Aristakus nga sakunda, nji wa Tasalonika, nga Gayus nji Darba, nga Timoti, ri Tikikus nga Tarofimas, nji wa Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Nji wanyi wa gbuchi ran gben ta ri gbu Taruwasa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ki ka wulunde ri Filibi ri mvu ima, riwa iri ri riwa a ran he mumu ri kpakpi fu ran, ki ka to wa ri Taruwasa ri vi ton wa a kɨwan hi. Mba ki ka son vi Tangban.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a hi ri wa hu Izhi ri kre.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Rimi vi ri gbuchi ri vi tangban, ki ka tu kabru ri wa ki ban juju yɨwon, Bulus ka tre wa, ri mibre, Ka tsi tre hi tsutsu chu. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Iwulu ri kpan ka he ri tra shu riwa ki ka kabru ki. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Ivrenze ri ka son ri tu windo riwa nde wan a he Aftikos, ka he rimi kru nna bran bran, Bulus ka ran bla tre, na ka ban wu, mba ka joku ri hon tra ri tra ran kuu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Mba Bulus ka gɨzhi ran ye me, ran lɨwen ikpa wan, ran zon ngawan riwuRan ri,&lt;&lt;Ran no sron mbi ti me ran&gt;&gt; Ran tre ri &lt;&lt;A he ri si!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ran bru hi ri tra ri shu nga ran fon juju yɨwon ran ri, ka son bran bran ran ri tre ri nji, ran wulunde hi nga wan. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Mba wa ka ban vren nze ri si nga wa ri ngɨri bran bran.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idzren zhu ri Toruwas hi Militus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Kita ki ka gbuchi hi ri nvu ima nga ki ka hi Asus, bubu wa ki ban Bulus. A gbuchi riwa a ri hi ri dza. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Riwa a ka to ta ri Asus, ki ban wu ri nvu ima, ki ka hi ri mitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ivi ri mibrewan ki gra nvu ima imba ki zhu ri kiyos. Ivi mba ki ka dza gran hi Samas, nga ri vi ri han ki ka zhu ri Militas. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Bulus ka tika iwa wu a ri hu nvu ima hi Afisa riwa a ran wu vi bran ri gbu Asiya ran, a ran chu gbla riwa a ri zhu Urushelima, ri vi Fentikos.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Riwa Bulus a hi ri Militas, ka ti wa ndu hi Afisa ri wa rinkon wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Riwa a ka zhu, ka tre riwa&lt;&lt;Bi to bibi riwa me son ri yi, ri vi riwa me ye ri meme Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Me ti ndu Bachi katu yo mme bran, nga ri ima si, me fe tre bran nga ri meme ti ri wa nji Yahuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Bi to me ran kawon tre kya riwa a ran zon yi ran me tre rimin si nji nga riko-riko. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Me la ri nji Yahuda nga wawa wa ran to Izhi ran no wa kɨwan hi ri Izhi no wa ka meme ti mba chuwo nga wa ri yo sron ri Bachi Yeso.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />&lt;&lt;Zizan, ri reresron ri Yuu Tsitsri me hi ri Urushelima, Me ran to kya riwa ari ti wen ri bubu wan ran. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Me to ri gbu ri gbu Iyu Tsitsri ri fen wen ton ri tra tre nga so ya ri gben wen. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Imba, me ran ban tu won ri a he kya ri mo ran, me wa me ri kre kya riwa me yo sron nga ndu riwa Bachi Yeso no wen me ti, riwa a he tre kɨrewultsu nga kɨrendu Bachi Yeso a no wen- ndu riwa me la tre alheri Jii.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Zizan me to bi yi wa ri me si zen bla tre shu wulu bi ran bru to wen nga ran. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ritu nganyi, me la ri hi ruwa me ran to kya rimin iyi njo ran he ritu won ngaran. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Me ran ka won chuwo ri bla tre Izhi ran. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />To ngambi nga gbu riwa a ka yi dzi bi ran ya wa. Bi ri he nji wa bi kshu wa hu Izhi, riwa a rehi ri yi wan. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Me to me hi ngawon, wa meme ti wa gra ri yi, wa ran to lo sron wa jibu nyi ran. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Wari rimi mbi nji wa ri wa Wulunde wa ri kpa tre ŋjaŋji ti me wa ri dzu miri ndu hi ngamba. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ngamba son ri ya Tika ise Tra me ran ka won ri la yi ri chu nga vi ri yi ran.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />&lt;&lt;Zizan, me ka yi chuwo ri wo Izhi nga tre dindi riwa a ri milan ta ti nga ran no ta gado riwa wa wu mbu ri tsitsri. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Me ran ti ŋgun ri nfan njo ka ri zinariya ka itsro njo ran. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Bi to kyumbi ri wa no wen kya riwa me ri nga kya riwa me no wawa wa he ri me. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ri kya wawu me ti, me tsro yi ri bibi ndu ya nyi ki zon wawa wa ran sen kpa ran, tika Bachi Yeso ri tu wan ran tre,&lt; kinklan sron he bran ri de han ri kpa &gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Riwa a tre nga nyi, ka ku mgbazhu riwa nga ran bre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Wa wu mba wa ka yi wa ri klo ri kpa nga wa ri manyu wan. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Wa ti shnji sron wawu mba ri tre wan riwa wa ran bru to si wan nga ran. Wa ka ngɨzhi wu tinkon ri nyu nvu ima.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a hi ri Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Mba ki ka ngambu chuwo, ki ka gra ri mvu ima ki ka zhu ri Kos, mibrewan ki ka hi kodusa, nga ki ka ye ri Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Riwa ki to nvu ima a ran hi Finikiya, ki ka gra rimin wan, ki ka hi. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Riwa ki to Kubrus ki ka ka wu chuwo ku wo ta, ki ka hi suriya, ki ka gɨzhi ri Taya: Mba nye nvu ima wa ri ka kpi mba sro. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ki to miri ndu Izhi, ki son riwa ivi tangban, tstsri ka la Bulus no ran hi Urushelima ran. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ivi mbu ka ti, ki ka wulude zren mbu, pɨen miri ndu ri imba mba ri miri wa ka ŋgɨshi ye ta ti nkon ri kankan gbu, mba ki ka ku ngbazhu ri shan ki ri bre. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ki ka gra ri mvu ima, wa ka hi ko mba. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Riwa ki ka hi Taya, ki ka zhu ri Talamayas, kika miri vayi, ki ka kru vi ri ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ri mibrewan, ki ka ye Kaisariya nga ki ka son ri ko Filibu riwa a ri bla tre, iri rimi tangban. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />A he ri miri mba nza riwa wa ran ro wa ran a ri yi anabci. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Ki son vi bran, nga nji ri la tre Izhi ri, wa nde wan Agabas ka ye ri Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ye rita, ka ban damara Bulus, lo wo wan nga za wan ran tre,&lt;&lt;tsitsri tre, nga nyi nji Yahuda wa Urushelima wa lo nji ri ntan ri lo tri nyi nga wa ri ka wu no Aluma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Riwa ki wo nga nji wa bre Bulus no ran hi Urushelima ran. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Bulus ka nyɨme,&lt;&lt;Bi yi nga kpa sron won ri tre ngye? me son kpen riwa wa ran lo wen nkankshe ran, ama riwa me kuu ri Urushelima rimi nde Bachi Yeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Riwa a ka wan ri njanyuwa, ki ka wu chuwo, ki ri tre,&lt;&lt;No Bachi ti kya riwa a bi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Mba ri vi bran, ki ka lo kpi mbu ki ka hi Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Miri ndu wari ri Kaisariya wa ka ngɨzhi ta ye ri ko Manason, bubu wa ki ka son. A he nji riwa a zhu ri kubrus nga iri riwa a he miri ndu ri gbu.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a hi Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Riwa ki ka zhu ri Urushelima, miri vayi mbu wa ka kpa ta ri si Sɨron. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ri mibreri han wan Bulus nga gbron mbu ki ka hi bubu to Yakubu, nga nji wa rinkon wa he nga wen. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Bulus ka chi wa nga ran gra la wa kya riwa Izhi a ti ri aluma ri ndu riwa a ri ti. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Riwa wa wo nga nyi, wa ka gbre Izhi. Wa ka tre ri Bulus:&lt;&lt;Wu to, miri vayi, ngo nji Yahuda wa kpa nyɨme, nga ikpa wawu wa ti ŋgu ri bla tre doka Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Wa la wawu wa tsro wa nji Yahuda riwa wa son ri aluma no wa ka bla tre doka Musa ta ga, wu ri tre ri wa no ran fon miri mba nju ran, no ran wu bibi ti mba ran. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ki ti se? Wa nji mbu wa wo ri wu he ri nyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ti kya ki la riwu. Wa he nji nza ri wu wawa wa ban shizhi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ban nji wa nyi, no wa Sran ngamba wawu, wu ri han wa kya mba wa ri hon wa fe krontu wa. Ri mba, ko nga riwa a to kya bi tre a ran he ŋjaŋji ran, a wu kiyaye bla tre. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ama ri aluma riwa wa kpa nyɨme, ki nga mbe ri wa, no wa ka ri ri riwa wa no gumaka chu wo, nga iyi, nga tan nɨma riwa a he ri yi, nga kru wa riwa a ran he wa wen ran. <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Imbɨre ri han wan Bulus ka vu nji ran sran ngawan riwa ngawen. Ran hi tra Izhi riwa a ri la wa vi sɨran-a ri kɨre nga de sadakar ri wawumba.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa nji Yahuda wa vu Bulus ri tra Bre.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Riwa ivi tangban a he huehyure, nji Yahuda wa ri wa zhu ri meme Asiya wa to Bulus ri tra Izhi, wa ka shonchi ikpa nji wari vu Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Wa ran kpa gro ran tre,&lt;&lt;Nji nji Yahuda, Zon ta! ngye nji nyi a ri tsro kpa nji ko kutan tre bla yɨwasi nji ri nyi. nga nji, riwa a ngɨzhi Hellenawa wa ri gra ri tra Izhi ran kpa ti zhii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Mba wa gbuchi to Turofimus mba Afisa ri wu rimi gbu, wa yo nga Bulus a ngɨzhi wu ye rimin tra Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Igbu wa wu ka wuru rifu nga nji wa ran wurutsu kan kan. Wa ka vu Bulus, wa ri gbi ri tra Izhi, nga wa ri ka nkon gbagbla. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Wa ran wa wuu Bulus, tre ka zhu ri chu wati ku Roma wa lo kpa gbu ri Urushelima ka rude. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Gbagbla vu wa ti ku nga jarumawa wa ri wa wuruts hi ikpa nji. Riwa a wa to ichu ti ku wa ka tsi Bulus chuwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Ichu ti ku ka ye ran vu ran la wa no wa lo wu ri che hari. Ran mɨye a he nga nga a ti ngaye. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Wa ri rimin kpa nji wa ran kpa gra ran tre kya kan kan, mba ichu ti ku ka ran to tu tre janji ran ritu zii nji, ran la wa no wa ban Bulus hi ri bru sojoji. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Bulus ka yi ri nyu matakala, isɨra nji ka bran wa ti ku wa ka ban wu jɨo. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Riwa ikpa nji wa ran wu wa kukon wa ri kpa gro, &lt;&lt;No wa hi ri wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a tre ri Kpa nji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Riwa wa klukpa-a wa ye wɨre-wɨreriwa wa ban Bulus hi ri mpwan wa lokpa , ka mɨye ichu ti ku,&lt;&lt;Me la wu tre kya ri? Wu tre Hallenenchi?&gt;&gt; Ka tre. <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />&lt;&lt;Wu ran he nji Masar nyi ri wa wu gbu nji wa nyi ri ngɨzhi wa meme ti ngo nza hi ri Izhi ri vi wa a hi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Mba Bulus ka tre, &lt;&lt;Me he nji Yahuda nye, ri Tarsus rimi Kilikiya, tsitsa gbu riwa wa to wen. Me ibreu me tre ri nji wa nyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Riwa ichu tiku ka no nyɨme Bulus ka ku kɨri ri matakala, ran nzu wo hi ri nji no wa ki mgbi, ran tre riwa ri rɨme nji Yahuda:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Imiri vayi won nga wati won, wo tre wonn riwa me la yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Riwa wa wo a tre ri wa ri rɨme Aramaic, waka ran yon kiŋgbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Mba Bulus ka tre: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />&lt;&lt; Ame mi he nji Yahuda nyen, wa ngji wen ri Tarsus, meme Kilikiya, ama rimi gbu nyi nyen mi gbron, waka tsro wen ri Gamaliya, ritu bla riwa wati mbu nga me ran su me ri gbresan Izhi bibi riwa biyi bi he luwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Me ran tre wawa wa ran hu nkon-a hi ri kuu mba, mi ran vu mba wawa ronron ran ta sro ri tra riwa wa tre nji, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Rinkon Firist nga wa kusan wan waya la ritu wan. Me kpa mbe riwa a ngji hi ri mirivayi mba ri Damasiku, mi ri vu wa ka wawa wa tre wa ye me ri no wa ya. <verse eid="ACT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />&lt;&lt; Riwa me hi hyure ri Damasiku, ikpan wulu ka zhu ri shu ye kpan tsro kusan won. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Mika joku ri meme iran ka zhu ri shu ye ran tre mo ri, &lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, ritu ngye ko wu no wen ya?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />&lt;&lt;&lt; Me ka nyime wu ri, a wu Izhi nyen?&gt; Me ka mɨyen. Yeso ka tre ri &lt;Ame me he Yeso nji Nazare riwa wu no wen ya.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Wawa wa hu wen wa to kpan wulu-a ama wa ran to ko iran nga nyen ri tre ri me ran. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />&lt; Ngye nyen me ti Izhi?&gt;Me mɨyen. Izhi ka tre wu ri&lt;Wulunde wu ri hi rimi Damasiku. Ri bubu wan nyen wa lawu wawu kya riwa wa yo-wu no ti.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Wawa wa hu wen waka gbu wen ri wo ngji hi ri Damasiku, ritu ikpan wulu-a ka kpa si won ti nfyen. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Nji ri wa ran yo wu ri Hananiya ka ye ri bubu to wen. A ran hu Izhi ri bubu bla riwa wawuu nji Yahuda wawa wa son ri bubu wan wa ran hu. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ka kɨri kusan won ran tre ri,&lt;Vayi Shawulu, kpa totsu wen!&gt; Ri bubu wan nba Me ka to-u.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Imba ka tre: &lt;Izhi riwa wati mbu a chu wu wuri to iti wan nga wu ri to riwa a he ri dindi ti wu ri wo tre ri nyu wan. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />A wu wu kpa nyu wan kusi nji ritu kya riwa wu to wuri wo. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Ko zizan ngye nyen wu gben? wulude, wa ri kawu son ri ima wari ngɨla meme ti wen rega, ri yo nde Izhi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Riwa me kɨma hi ri Urushelima, me ran bre ri tra Izhi, ira ka ye ri mo <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />me ka wo ran Izhi a tre mo ri.&lt;Gbagbla!&gt; Ka tre ri mo.&lt;ka Urushelima don, ritu wa ran kpa tre won ri nyu wen ran,&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Bachi,&gt;Me tre, wawa ma wa to bibi riwa me ran hu ri tra Izhi me ran vu nji ran tre nga me ri ran tsi wawa wa kpa nyɨme ri wu. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Riwa wa ka yi Istifanas rega, riwa a ran kpa nyu wen, ame nga wen me he ri bubu wan me ri ran sho wa ŋchi ritu kya riwa wa ti, nga me ran gben tsro wawa wa ran wuu wu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Imba Bachi ka tre mo ri,&lt;Hi,&gt; Me tiwu ndu hi ri bubu kpata ri wawa wa ran to Izhi ran.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus Nji Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Igbuŋji wa ki ran gben riwa a ke ri wɨlo tre. Imba waka ran kpagro ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;No wa wuu! Bibi nji mba ran he riwa wa chu wa wo ran!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Riwa wa ran kpagro wari ran ta tsro mba ran ban shu wari ran chu wuru ran ban shu, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />rinkon wa klukpa ka tre ri no wa ngji wu hi rimi mpwan mba wari tsi ri gbagba wari ran mɨyen kya riwa a ti riwa kpaŋji wa kpagɨro ri wu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Riwa wa vu nɨme yo riwa wa tsi, Bulus ka miyen nji ri klukpa riwa a kɨri ri bubu wan,&lt;&lt;A tsra nowa tsi nji ri Roma riwa a ran ti meme ti kya ran?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Riwa nji ri kɨlu kpa-a ka wo ngamba, ka hi ri rinkon wa klukpa ran ka la wu.&lt;&lt;ko wu ti se mba ron?&gt;&gt;Ka myen.&lt;&lt;Nji nyin a he nji Roma nyen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Rinkon wa klukpa-a ka hi ri Bulus ran mɨyen, &lt;&lt;La wen, a wu wu he nji Roma nyen?&gt;&gt;Ka nyɨme riwu ri wawu he nji Roma nyen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Imba rinkon wa klukpa ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Me han nkɨren bran ko me fe son ri gbu.&gt;&gt;Ama Bulus ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ame wa ngji wen ri gbu,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Wawa wa ran wa wa ri mɨyen tre waka zhu ri gon. Wawu rinkon wa klukpa ritu wan ka ti sisɨri ritu riwa a to ri wawu a vu Bulus nji Roma lo.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa ngɨzhi Bulus hi Kusi Wa Bla Tre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ri mbɨre ri hari wan, riwa rinkon wa klukpa a ran wa ran wo kya riwa a ti ko nji Yahuda waka ngɨzhi wu hi ri chu gbu, ka chu wu chuwo ran yo wa rinkon wan wawu nowa ye, mba ka ngɨzhi Bulus ye ran kɨri kusi mba.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Bulus ka sro si ran ya wa rinkon-a ran tre, &lt;Miri vayi, Me kre ndu won ri Izhi ri sron rɨrɨ ri vi nyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Hananiya rinkon wa ndu Izhi ka la wawa wa kuki hyure ri Bulus wari wuru wu ri nyu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Imba Bulus ka tre ri wu, a wu ri meme sron, &lt;&lt;Izhi ri wuru-u ri nyu ngawen! Wu son ri mba wuri ri bla tre ri mo bibi riwa a he ri doka, ama wu ran hu doka ran wu lawa ri nowa wuru wen!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Wawa wa ki hyure ri Bulus wa tre, &lt;&lt;Wu ran to ri wu kra nji rinkon ri ndu Izhi tu ran?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Bulus ka tre,&lt;&lt;Miri vayi, me ran to ri a he rinkon wa ndu Izhi ran, ritu a he ri nga: &lt;Ran tre tre meme ritu wa rinkon wa nji mbi ran.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Riwa Bulus a to ri wari mba wa he Sadukyawa, nga ngbromba wa he wa nji Farisa, ka yo wa rinkon-a ri, &lt;&lt;Miri vayi won wa nji Israila, me he nji Farisa nye, ivren Farisa. Wa tsra wen rinyi ritu me he ri yosron ri wawa wa kuu wa bru tashme!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Riwa Bulus a tre ngamba, ijanyu ka gra ri wa Farisa nga Sadukyawa, riwa ikabrutu mba ka ga ti hari. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Wa nji Sadukyawa waka tre ri, itashɨme ran he ran, ba kuma miriko Jii, ko iyu. Wa nji Farisa waka kri ri wawu mba wa he. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ijanyu ka wulunde, wawa wa tsro tre Musa wa gbu Farisa waka wulunde ki nde, waka gra ri janyu. &lt;&lt;Ki ran bru fe meme ti rɨ ri nji nyi ran,&gt;&gt;Wa tre. &lt;&lt;Idan a he iyu ka ivrenko Izhi nyen a tre fa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ijaŋyu-a ka ngji waŋyu ye ri wa riwa rinkon wa klukpa ka ran ti sisiri ritu ka wa gbu wu ti zhuzhu. ka la wa ŋduwan no wa gre wari hi gbu ka kawa don ran ngɨzhi wu ye rimi mpwan. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Ri chu ri hari wan Bachi ka kɨri kusan Bulus ran tre,&lt;&lt;Vu sron, Bibi riwa wu kpa nyu won ri Urushelima, ngamba nyen wu kpa nyu won ri Roma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Rinkon wa Kadzi Ri Wa Wuu Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Mibreka kpan, nji Yahuda waka vu nyu ri wawa wa ran ri ka wa ri so kyari ran ri tse wawa wa wuu Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Wawa wa kadzi ri wa wuu Bulus wa ke nji ŋgibresenza. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Wa hi ri w Firist ri wa rinkon wari tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ki shiiji ri ki ran ri ko ki so kyari ran tse ki wuu Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />A he ngamba biyi wa rinkon bi hi ri la rinkon wa klukpa ri no ngɨzhi wu ye no yi, a zhu mba ka bi wa bi ri mɨlan bru miyen tu tre wan ri, kita ki mɨlan ki ritu ki wuu-u ri ko no ye zhuu nyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Riwa ivren vayi Bulus ka wo kya riwa wa wa wari ti, ka tsutsu hi ri ko wa klukpa ran ka la Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Imba Bulus ka yo nji wa klukpa ri ran la wu ri,&lt;&lt;Ngɨji vrenze nyin hi ri kusi nji rinkon a he ri kya riwa a riwa ran lawu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Imba nji ri klukpa ka ban Bulus riwa wa tren-u-a hi kusi rinkon wa klukpa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Nji ri klukpa ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Bulus, nji riwa wa vu tren-a, a tiwen ndu ri wu ran tre ri mi ngji vrenze nyin ye ri wu ri a he ri kyari riwa ari la wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Rinkon wa klukpa ka gbi vrenze-a ri wo hi ri gran ran mɨyen wu yayɨbi ri,&lt;&lt;Ngye nyen wu ri wu su wu ri la mo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ivrenze-a ka tre,&lt;&lt;Ri nji Yahuda wa nyime ri wa miyen wu ri no ngɨzhi Bulus ye kusi wa rinkon mibreri gbundo ritu wa ri mɨlan wo tre ritu wan. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ran nyɨme ri wa ran, ritu wa ke senza donton riwa wa gben. Wa shiiji ri wawa wa ran ri ko wari so ran tse wawa wa wuu-u. Wa ki ri gben wu don wuri no wa nkon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Rinkon wa klukpa ka la vrenze-a ri no hi ngawan,&lt;&lt;Ran la njo tre riwa wu la wen-a ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa klukpa wa Ti Bulus ndu hi Ri Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Imba rinkon wa klukpa ka yo wa klukpa ti hari ran la wa ri, &lt;&lt;zhu wa klukpa ŋgibregbigba hari, nga wa hon ima ŋgibresetangban nga wa ta wɨyen ŋgibregbigba hari ki hi ri kaisariya ri krefi chu wa ri chu nyi. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />A lawa ri no wa wa ŋɨma riwa Bulus ri hon hi ri rinkon ri Felis ri senkpa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />A nga mbe ri wa a he ngayin: <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Juu ri Kalaudiyas Lisiyas hi ri wawu ri kpanchi ri gbu Felis. Tɨrewu bran bran. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Nji nyi nji Yahuda wa vu ri wawa wa wuu, ama mi ye ri wa ndu won ki ri kpa chuwo, ritu me wo ri a he nji Roma nyen. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Me ran wa me ri to ngye nyen Bulus ti ko wa vuu, mi ka ngɨzhi wu hi ri wa rinkon mba. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Mi to kya riwa wa vuu Bulus ritu wan a he ritu imɨyen ritu doka mba, ama ikyari ran he riwa a ke riwa wa wuu-u ko wa vu tre ran. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Riwa me wo kya riwa wa kadzi ritu Bulus, me truu ye ri yi meron. Nga me no wawa wa vu-a nowa ngji tre mba ye ri wu ritu wan. <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Imba wa klukpa wa ka ban Bulus bibi riwa wa lawa ngɨzhi hi ri gbu Antibatrisi ri chu. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Mibrerɨa waka ka wa gbegbe chuwo riwu no wa ban kusi, ngbɨron mba waka kɨma hi ngamba ri mpwan. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Riwa wa gbegbe wa ke ri Kaisariya, waka ka mbe-a nga Bulus ka no Felikus. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Rinkon ŋji-a ka kɨra mbe-a ran mɨyen ri Bulus he nji gbu tan nyen? Riwa a wo ri a he nji kilikiya nyen, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Rinkon gbu ka tre,&lt;&lt;Me wo tre wen ka wawa wa vu-u wa ye zhi ri nyin.&gt;&gt;Imba ka lawa no wa Bulus ran gben dzi ri tra bla tre wa Hiridus.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Nji Yahuda wa Ngji Bulus Hi Ri Kusi Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Riwa a ti vi ton rinkon wa tsro tre Izhi, nga Hananiya waka ye wawa wa rinkon nga nji ri bla tre riwa wa yo ri Tartulus, waka nji tre mba ritu Bulus ye kusi nji rinkon. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Riwa wa yo Bulus ye rimi, Tartulus ka ngɨzhi tre wan ye kusi nji rinkon:&lt;&lt;Ki ran ri raro nga ri sisron, iya kusi wen a ngɨzhi sran ye ri gbungblume. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Ko minyi, ko ri nkon ritan, a wu Felis rinkon rigbu, ki kpa rinyi ri ngɨri. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ama ritu ki ran no wu ya ran, Me ibreu wuri sɨren ton ri wo ta. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />&lt;&lt;Ki fe nji nyin a he nji riwayun nyen, ari ngɨzhi wanyun ye rimi nji Yahuda ko kutan ri gbungblume. Wawu nyen he rinkon ri gbu Nazarawa, <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Nga wa su ran kpa bubu bre Izhi time, ki ka vu ngɨzhi. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ama lisiyas rinkon wa klukpa ka ye ran kpa ri gbengbren <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Riwu ya-u kyuwen, wu to kya kpunji ritu tre riwa ki ngɨzhi ye ritu wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Nji Yahuda ngawen waka kpa hu wa, ri a he ngamba nyen. <verse eid="ACT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Riwa nji rinkon no ri no tre, Bulus ka tre:&lt;&lt;Me to ri sisenmu ri wu he nji ri bla ri gbungblume, ri kinklan sron me kpa nyu ngawon. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Wu ya mɨlan wo ri a ran han vi wurudon hari riwa me hi ri Urushelima me ri gbresan nde Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Wawa wa ran kɨrawentu wa ran fe wen me janyu ri njo ri tra bre Izhi ran, ko me kpaŋji ran pɨsi ri tra Izhi ko ka ri bubu ri nkan rimi gbu. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Wa ran ya la kpunji ri wu ritu kya riwa wa tre ritu won ran. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Aran he ngamba nye me yɨme ri me hu Izhi riwa wati mbu ka wawa wa hu gba riwa wa yo ri irɨme. Me kpa nyɨme ko ŋge riwa wa yɨme ri doka nga a he rimi nga ri wa la tre Izhi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Me yo sron ri Izhi bibi wa nji mba, ri vi riye riwa wawa wa kuu wa tashime ri wa dindi ti riwa meme ti. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Me ti kukuri me ri no sron won no he kinklan kusi Izhi nga kusi nji. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Kugon ise riwa wa vu yɨwa, me ran ye ri Urushelima me ri ngɨzhi de won ngji hi no wa ya nga me ri de sraka. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Me he rimi ti kamba waka fe wen rimi tsɨtsɨri ri tra bre, gbunji wa ran he ri me ran, me ran ran kpagɨro ran. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />nji Yahuda wari wa he riwa wa zhu ri Asiya, wa wa wari ye ri wu wari ngɨzhi tre won ye ri wu ka wa he ri kyari ritu won. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ka nji mba ritumba wa ya la kya riwa wa fe wen ri wu riwa me he kusi wa rinkon, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Ara riwa me kpagɨro ka mi kɨri kusi mba,&lt;A he ritu tre tashime wawa wa kuu nyen me he ri kusi mbi luwa.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felis riwa a he ri tu to ritu nkon-a ka lawa ri no wa kawa chuwo, ran tre, me rimiren ritu tre mbi. <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ka no rinkon wa klukpa ri no kɨshu Bulus ti ran gben ama no chu wu wo no vɨri, no ran dzu wa kpan wan ri ye ri bubu ya wu ran. <verse eid="ACT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />A ti vi hari Felis nga wa wan, Durusila, a he ivɨra nji Yahuda. ka ti ndu no wa ngɨzhi Bulus ye, ka sɨren ton ran wo wu ritu tre kpanyɨme ri Bachi Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Bulus ka ran bla tre ritu ti dindi ti, ri vu tu, nga no ya riwa ari ye, Felis ka ti sisiri ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;No kɨreron! Wu ya hi ngawen ron.Ka me fe nkon, Me tiwa ndu riwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ritu a ran yo sron ri Bulus ri no wawu nkɨren, ritu wan nyen a ran ye ri wu ri so ri so, ran tre riwu. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Riwa ise hari ka vu yɨwa, Pokiyus Festu ka kpa kpanchison Felis. Felis ritu riwa a ran wa no yi wan no ban nji nji Yahuda, ka chu Bulus wo ri tra tre.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Itsra Bulus Kusi Festu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Riwa Festu a ke ri bubu son wan, ka ti vi tre ran hi Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Wa rinkon wa tsro tre Jii nga wa rinkon ri nji Yahuda waka ngɨzhi Bulus hi kusi wan, waka ibreu, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Ri no zon wawa, ran ti ndu ri no wa ngɨzhi Bulus ye ri Urushelima, ritu wa ka zi ri wa wuu ri nkon. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festu ka nyɨme ran tre,&lt;&lt;Bulus ri son ri tra tre, nga ame nga wen me wa me ri hi ri bubu wan ri vivi nyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />No wa ri kon mbi wari no wa hu ri men ki hi idan bi vu nji nyi ri meme ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />A ran han vi tandara ka vi wuru riwa Felis ka son ri kaisanya mibrerɨa wan ka vu yi ki ran tre no wa ngɨzhi Bulus ye kusi wan. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Riwa ka ye ya wu nji Yahuda riwa wa zhu ri Urushelima waka kagon wan ki wa ran ngɨzhi tre wa ri bran ran ye ritu wan riwa wana nyɨme ri wa ran.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ame me ran ti meme ti kya ritu bi ta tre nji Yahuda, ko ri tre bre Izhi, ko ritu kaisar ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Wawu Festu ritu riwa a ran wa no nji Yahuda no wa fu wawu, ka nyame ran tre ri Bulus ri,&lt;&lt;No nyɨme ran hi ri Urushalima no wa bla tre riwa ri bubu wan ritu kya riwa wa he kusi won?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Ama Bulus ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Me kri rinde a he no wa bla tre rimo me ran ti meme ti kya ri nji Yahuda ran, ama ritu tu wen wu to wen. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Idan me he nji ri ti meme ti riwa me ti kya ri wa a tsra riwa wa wuu wen, me ran jɨbu ri wo mba ran ama idan kpunji tre ran he ri tirerewa bi ngɨzhi nji wen hi ran wa nji riwa a ri ya kawen rekusi mba don ran no wa sisron me wa no wa ngɨzhi tre won hi kusi kaisa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Kugon ri wa Festu ka ti shawara ri majalisa, ka nyɨme ran tre ri &lt;&lt;Wu wa no wa ngji tre wen hi ri Kaisar kusi kaisar njen wa ngɨzhi wu hi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festu a wa chu Agaribas hi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Riwa a ti vi hari Agaribas nga Barniki waka ye ri kaisariya don wari kpa Festu ri nkon. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Ritu wa ti vi bran ri bubu wan Festu ka la chu tre Bulus ran tre,&lt;&lt;Nji ri he riwa Felis ka kawu chuwo ri tra tre. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Wawa riwa me he ri Urushelima wa rinkon wa la tre Jii nga wa rinkon wa Urushelima wa ngɨzhi tre wan ye ri me, wa ri ibrewen ri me no ya.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ame me ka nyɨme meri tre, a ran he bibi ti mbi Romawa no wa no njo ya ran don wa ri no njo sisiron ran, ka wawa wa ngɨzhi tre wan ye wa ran he nga nji riwa wa ngɨzhi tre wan hi nga wen a ran he ran ko a ri kpanyu ngawan. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ritu ngamba, riwa wa ye ri nyi riwa wa mi ran no tre-a wa ban ji ran me hon ritu bubu bla tre meri no wa ngɨzhi nji-a ye. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Wawa wa ngji tre ye-a wa wulunde kri nde, wa ran ngji tre meme ritu wan bibi riwa me yo siron ritu wan ye ran. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Tsede wa janyu ritu tre zhi mba , nga nde wan a he Yeso, riwa a kuu, ama Bulus ka kɨri ritu, ri a ran kuu ran. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Ame riwa mɨran to bibi riwa me hunchi kyawa wamba ran, me ka mɨyen Bulus ka ari nyɨme ran hi Urushelima nowa bla tre wan-a rimu ritu bibi kyawa wamba. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ama Bulus ka wa ri nowa ka tre wan chuwo nga Ichu Kaisar ka ya wu, mika lawa ri nowa vu zi ri se miri ti ndu hi nowa ngɨzhi wu hi ri Kaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agaribas ka la ri Festu ri&lt;&lt;Ame me wa meri wo nji mba kyuwon.&gt;&gt; Ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Wu wo-wu mbre.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa ngji Bulus hi Kusi Agaribas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ri mibrerɨa wan Agaribas nga Banis waka ye ri wa zon, waka gra ri tra wa bla tre nga wa rinkon wa tiku nga wawa wa wo wa ri gbu wa ka ngɨzhi Bulus ye gra ri nyɨme Festu. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Nga Festu ka tre,&lt;&lt;A wu ichu Agaribas, nga wawu nji riwa wa hi ri ta, bi to nji nyin nga wawu nji wa nji Yahuda wa nji tre wan ye ri me ri Urushelima, nga wari ran kpagɨro ri a ran he riwa wa chu wu wo no he ri si ran. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ama ame me ran to kya riwa a ti riwa a tsra riwa wa wuu wu ran. wawu kyuwan a bu nyu tre ri me nowa ngɨzhi tre wan hi ri kusi nji rinkon Kaisar, me yo sron ritu me ngɨzhi wu hi ri wu. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ama me ran he ri tre riwa me nga ri Bachi ritu wen ran. Ritu ngamba me ngɨzhi wu ye kusi mbi, masama ri kusi wen, a wu ichu Agaribas, ritu kugon riwa wa hu nchi tre ritu kya riwa me nga. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ritu ame, ri towon, ari he ndu kuklu nowa tre ri wa ngɨzhi nji riwa wa tre wu hi wa ran tsro kya riwa a ti ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Imba Agaribas ka la Bulus ri,&lt;&lt;Wu he ri nkon riwa wu tre ri ngawen.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Bulus ka nzu wo ran gbuchi ran kpa nyu ngawan: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;lale me he ri wo a wu ichu Agaribas, tunde a he kusi won nye me ngɨzhi tre won ri ye ritu tre won riwa nji Yahuda wa ngji ye, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Adzidzan ritu a wu wu to bran ritu nji Yahuda nga tre mba ritu ngamba, me ibrevu sron wuri wo wen.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt; Bibi son riwa mi ti tu ka me he ri nze, rimi memewon ri nji won nga ri Urushelima hari ye luwa Yandawa wa to bi ran. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wa to wu ri kpanji, riwa wa ri nyime wari kpa nyu ri lale me he nji Farisa nye ritu lrɨme nye ran ti wulu bran rimi ti mba riwa mbu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />A he ritu me yo sron ritu me ri ye tsra tre won nyi nye riwa Izhi ti ri wa timbu nye me he ri nyi wo wa bla tre ri mo. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Rinyi igɨji mbu wuru don hari wa yo sron ri no he ri hu Jii ri mbireri chu, wa yo siron wari to ye tsra wan ritu yo siron-a nye nji Yahuda wa kɨra wentu. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />A he rise ri Jii ri no wawa wa kuu nowa tashɨme, ama ran kawan ri kpa nyɨme ri yi?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Ame ri tuwon me to ri ka a he lale nye me ti wawu kya ritu no nde Yeso Nji Nazare no ran hi kusi ran. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Me ti kamba ri Urushelima, me ka fe nyɨme ri wa rinkon wa la tre Jii, me vu wawa wa he Tsitsri tre bran ri tra tre riwa wa ran wuu wa me ka ran shuwa nchi ngawen. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Me ran hi ri tra Jii meri ran nowa ya me ran nowa yɨwa nyu. Ritu tifu ri wa, me ka huwa ri wu hi nga ri gbu riwa wa he kugiran mba, me ran nowa ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />&lt;&lt;Rimi ngamba nye, me ran hi ri Damasiku ri nyime wa ri riwa wa la tre Jii nga ndu mba. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Ri gbege ji ri nkon, a wu ichu, me to kpanwulu ka zhu ri shu a han ikpan ji, a kpan kagon mbu wawa kpan zren won. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Riwa wawu mbu ki joku ri meme, me ka wo ran ka ran tre ri me ri nji Yahuda ri, Shawulu, shawulu, Ritu ngye wu nowen ya? A he ndu kuklu riwa wu wanyu ri ame tiko wen.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />&lt;&lt;Imba me ka miyen-u ri,&lt;A wu wu he nga nye, a wu Bachi?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">Bachi ka tre,&lt;A he ame Yeso riwa wu no ya. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Wulunde wu ri kɨrinde, me ngɨzhi ngawon ye riwu ritu wuri tokya riwa wu to rɨme nga kya riwa mi tsro-u. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Me kpawu chuwo riwa wa nji wen Israila, nga wawa wana to Izhi ran riwa me tiwu ndu ri wa. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Ran bu si mba ran kɨma si mba ri bu hi ri kpan, nga ri wo meme nji hi ri wo Jii, riwa wa ka meme ti mba chuwo riwa nga bubu riwa wa kɨma wari ki ri yo siron ri me.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />&lt;&lt; Imba, ichu Agaribas, me ran kawon ri tre riwa a zhu ri shu ye rɨme-a ran. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ri mimilan, me la tre Jii ri nji Damasiku nga meri la ri Urushelima nga kagon gbu Yahudaya, nga me ri la wawa wa ran hu Izhi ran nga wari ti kya riwa ari tsro ri wa ka meme ti mba rega. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ritu ngamba nye Yandawa waka vu wen ri tra ibrewan ran wa wari wuu wen. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Riwa mi fe zon ri ji, me he ri nyi han zɨzan, me la ri ti nga vren, me ran ri la kyari ran ara kya riwa wa la tre Jii nga musa wa tre ri ari ye, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ri a he lale nye Bachi ri shaya wawu nye ri gbuchi tashɨme ri bubu gyuru, ran la gbunji ri wawa wa ran to Jii ran ikpan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ka Bulus a ran ngɨzhi tre wan ran ye Festu ka bu nyu mgban gban ran tre,&lt;&lt;Bulus, wu he nji ri che nye!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ikpa kɨlan wen-a a kpa tu wan kɨma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ama Bulus ka tre,&lt;&lt;A wu rikon Festu, me ran ri ti che ran, kpunji tre me la, rimi kasiron yo rɨme. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Ikya riwa ari he nyi wa a wu chu to nga me tre riwu me ran ti sisri ran, me to ri ikyari ran jibu ri siron rimi nji wawa wa ran to Jii ran ikya riwa wa ti mba-a a ran he ri yayibi ran. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />A wu ichu Agaribas, wu kpanyɨme ri wa la tre Jii? Ame me to ri wu kpanyime.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agaribas ka la Bulus,&lt;&lt;Rimi vi vren vi nyi nye huwa wuri nowen me hu Jii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Bulus ka tre,&lt;&lt;Ko ran he ri vi mba ko ri bi ran wan, me yo siron ri Jii, A ran he a wu nkankshiwen ran, ka hu ri wawa wa wowen luwa wari he bibi riwa me he imi che nyi,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ichu ka wurunde nga nji ri kpanchi nga Barniki, wawa wa he ri wa ri bubu wan. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Riwa wa ki ri bubu ri, waka ti shawara, wari tre,&lt;&lt;nji mba a ran ti kya riwa a ke nowa wuu-u ko wa lo wu ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agaribas ka la ri Festu,&lt;&lt;A he ritu nji mba ngɨzhi tre wan hi ri Kaisar igyen bi ri kawu chuwo no hi ngawan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a Gra ri Nvu Mma hi ri Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Riwa wana wa wari wurunde rimi nvu ima hi ri gbu Italiya, waka ka Bulus nga nji wari wawa wa tre wa ka no nji ri klukpa ri, wa yonde wan ri Yuliyas, ri kpa wa lo kpa ngori riwa Kaisar Augustus. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Riwa ki gra ri nvu ima ri riwa Adaramitiya, riwa a ran wa ran wurunde hi ri gbu wari kusi Asiya, kika ran hi, Aristakus nji tasalonika ri gbu Makidoniya ka he rita. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ri mibrerɨa wan kika hi ri sidon, Yuliyas ka ti dindi ri Bulus, ka no ri no hi ran to kpanwan ri nowa dzon wu. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Riwa ki wurunde ri bubu wan ri nvu ima-a kika kɨma hu kugon kubrus, ritu gungu a yota kusi. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Riwa ki rugran ba riwa a he kusan gbu Kilikiya nga Bamfiliya, kika ka zhu ri Mira ri gbu likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ŋba nji ri klukpa ka fe nvu ima ri Ishandariya riwa a ran hi ri gbu italiya, ka kata sro rimi wan. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kika ti vi ri vi ki ri ran hi rere, riwa kika zhu riya ri gbu kinida, ŋba ngungu ka nota ki ran hi kusi ran, kika hu bubu riwa ngungu a ran ran ti ran ku gbu Salmoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />kiran hu ri kusan nyu ba ri ya, kika zhu ri bubu riwa wa ran yo ri bubu riwa wa kpa nyɨwe riwu, riwa a he kusan gbu Lasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Tunde wa no vi bran, izren ngawen he meme, ivi ri vu nyu a vuyɨba, Bulus ka ran nghɨron wa, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />ka lawa ri,&lt;&lt;Biyi nji wamba, izren nyin ri he ri iya nga meme kigbu, a ran ri kpi nga nvu ima nkakshe ran, nga wa sron mbu ngawen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ama rinkon nji ri lokpa-a, ka yo sronwan ri nji riwa a ri tru nvu ima-a kankshe nga nji ri nvu ima-a, a ran ritu kya riwa Bulus a tre ran. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Riwa yake bubu ri tu won ran he ka bibi nvu ima nowa ri su rimi wan ran wari wa ngɨzhi shawara ye ri ki wurunde ri bubu wan, ko ka ari ya ngɨzhi ta hi ri Finikiya, a he bubu ri tu Karita, riwa ari ya kusi nzan nga kusi yawulu, isu ka fe wa ri bubu wan.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wo Wulu ka Ti ri Nne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Riwa gungu ka ran zhu ri kudu ran fu, rimi mba no yosron mba no nowa kya riwa wa wa, imba waka gbi anka jo waka hu kugran ri meme karita hyure ri gashi. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Aran ban vi bran ran, nchon gungu ri ka ye ka ti zhu ri bubu riwa ima a kagon wan. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Riwa gungu a wuru nvu ima-a, ka ran to kɨma si ya hu ran, kika kambu ran hi me. ka ran kɨbu ta. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Riwa ki hu ku gran pka gbu riwa ima a kɨshu wu ti ri a he kauda kika fe ki ri sangbɨren ri nvu ima mbu no he wa mbu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Riwa wa gbi tsitsa nvu ima-a yo rimi nvu ima ri bren, waka ti wiwɨri wari lowa jiji ri ŋchi nvu ima ri bran, waka fon wu rega. Don no tsuwan no ran zhu wa rega ri meme nzan ri sirtis riwa ari mɨye ko ngye, waka gɨzhi wakpi wari chu wu wo ka ran hi ngawan. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Nchon ngungu ka ran nota rimɨren kpunji, mibrerɨa wan waka gbuchi ran vu kpi riwa nvu ima-a a vu ran vɨra, rimi ima. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ri vi ri tra wan, wawa ritu mba waka vu kpi ndu nvu ima ta rega. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Riwa ki ti vi bran,ki ran to ko ntsen ran, ka gungu nga wowulu ka ran wuru ta ri bubu wan, kika zhu ri sron mbu ri ki ran jɨbu ran. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ritu ki ti vi hari ki ran ri kyari ran, Bulus ka wulunde krinde ri tsutsu mba, ran tre &lt;&lt;Biyi nji, riwa bi wo tre won, bi ri ran wulunde ri gbu riwa ima kshu-u ti ri karita bi ri gra rimi nkon riwa ki zhu ri hasara ran. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />To zizan me no yi tre bi ri vu sron, ritu njo ran rasa rewan rimi mbi ran: ari ra jɨbu wo nvu ima-a. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ri chu iren ivren ndu Jii riwa ame me yo-u nyen, nga miri hu, ka kɨri kusan won, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ran tre, &lt;Bulus ran ti sisiri ran, A wu wu kɨri ri kusi Kaisar ichu Roma, Izhi ri losron riwu ran tre ri wa kpanwen, nji riwa a hu-u ari nawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ritu ngamba, bi ka vu sron, biyi nji, ritu me nyime ri Izhi ri ti bibi riwa a lawen-a ngamba nyen wati. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ama fa lele nyen waka yi vɨra ri gbu riwa ima kshu-u ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Rimi chu ri wuru don nza, nga ri vi wurudon nza waka dzu ta ri sakaka ri ba rimi nne ri Adariya, ri tsutsu chu wawa wa ran tru nyu ima wa ri ke he hyure ri meme. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Waka tsra ronɨma ri dzidzan, waka fe idza ngo ri ri se hari, riwa ki ban kusi hi, ki ran bru tsra wu to ki fe ngamba idza ton. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ritu wa ran ti sisiri nowa ran kawa rega ritu tita ran, waka bru fon anka ngbɨre nza ri kugon nvu ima ka rega, wa ran bre Izhi no me bre hi ri kpan mbre. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Wa tru nvu ima wana wari tsustsu rimi nvu ima-a, waka yo si ri nvu ima ri tsitsa-a rimi ima, wari ran ti kama wa wa wa ri fon ŋchi nvu ima taga. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ama Bulus ka la wa rinkon wa klukpa nga wa klukpa ka nji wa nyi wa ran kɨri rimi nvu ima ran, ba kyari riwa bi ti bi ri kpa ngambi chuwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Wa klukpa waka suru jiji ri nvu ima tsitsa rega wari chuwo no hu ima. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Riwa mibreka gon ran kpan Bulus ka bre wa ri nowa ri viri ran tre,&lt;&lt; Luwa he vi ri wurudon nza bi ran ri kyari ran bi ki ri gben. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Ritu kamba, misu bi ri wakyari ri ritu lafiya ŋbi, tunde a he ri nfutu ran yɨra njo rimi ŋbi ran. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Riwa a la ngamba Bulus ka ban ŋɨma juju yɨmo ran ngɨri ri Jii kusi mba wawu, mba ka fɨren ran ka ri. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Wawu mba waka wulunde ki, wawa kyumba waka ran riri <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Kita wawu mbu rimi nvu ima-a ki he gbigba hari ri setangban don tanren. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Riwa wa ri wari hwɨshi, waka ran rege ri nvu ima-a, waka ran ka Alikama ran rega rimi ima.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ka me bre ka kpan wa tru nvu ima wa ran to ri bubu riwa wa ngɨzhi ran, ama waka milan ya iwɨri ri gbuchi ri meme ngaghɨmu, waka de tre ri, ikya riwa a ri he ki nowa ngji nvu ima-a hi zi ri bubu ngaŋɨmu. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Waka sii wa nkan wawu wari kawa chuwo ri ima, wari ran si bubu riwa wa lo nvu ima a nga waka ran zhu flafla ri chi nvu ima ri gungu ka tru wa ri kpa gashi. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ama riwa ki ke ri bubu riwa ima ga wa tru nvu ima-a hi ri bubu ngaŋɨmu, hari ichiwan ka fon ka ran manaa ri ngaghɨmu. A gbuchi ran nzu gbre bre ritu isra shi ima-a. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Wa klukpa wa ran wa wari wuu nji wawa wa vu wa tre bibi riwa wa ran to dran ima ran jɨbu wo ran. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Wawu rinkon wa klukpa a ran wa ran kpa Bulus chuwo ran nowa ran ti kya riwa wa hi ran ti-a ran, ran tre ri nji riwa aya ziran ima ka za gra ran dran zhu. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Ngbron mba wari wa hon ritu nibrekonkron , wari wa hon ritu ŋibrenvu ima-a. Ri ngamba, wawu mba waka zhu ri nyu ba.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ri Tsibirin Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Riwa ki jɨbuwo ki ka wo, iri ndu tsibirin-a he Malita nyen. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />nji wa gbu waka ti dindi ri ta bran, wa mo wulu rita wari kpata, kita wawu, rita riwa iwulu, nga isi ka ran ti. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Riwa Bulus ka vu juju konkiron ka sro rimi wulu, nga iwan ri ka zhu rimi wulu-a rita ritu gbaji ran nye-u ri wo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Riwa nji wa gbu wa to iwan ka nye ri wo Bulus, waka la kamba ri, &lt;&lt;Lale nji nyin a he nji ri wuu nji nyen, bi to ko riwa ide a jɨbu ri tsutsu ima, doka ri kamba dindi ti ri ran hu hi ri nkon kuu wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Bulus ka kpo iwan-a yo rimi wulu, ikyari ka ran ti wu ran. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Wawa wa ran yo sron ri bubu wan ri hu, ko ka no kuu. Ama riwa wa to aban vi bi ran ikya ka ran ti wu ran, wa bru tre ri wawu he vi zhi ri nyen.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ri kusan ri bubu wan fili ri a he, a he Mallakar rinkon ri tsibirin-a nyen, nde wan a he Fubiliyus. Wawu nyen ka kpata, ka gɨzhi ta ri ko wan ti vi tra. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Iti Fubiliyus a kiru ri me a ran he ri si ran, isru a ran tiwu Bulus ka gra riwu ran bre Izhi ri wu, ka yo wo riwu ran no si. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Riwa wa ti kamba wawu nga riwa wa ran he ri si ran waka vu ye riwu ka ran nowa si. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Waka no ta kpi kigbu, riwa ki wurunde rimi nvu ima, waka ran vu kyawa riwa ki suwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Gra Ri Roma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ka ti huwa tra, kika wurunde rimi nvu ima riwa Iskandariya a risuu ri gbu riwa ima a kagon wan nyin. Waka ti alama riwu ri ŋngaremiri ron-ron ti hari. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Riwa ki ye ri Sirakusa ki ri kuru ti vi tra ri nyin. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Ri bubu wan ŋba ki ka Zɨren kiri ke ri Rigiyum. Riwa ki kuru, gungu ka zhu ri kudu, ŋibrerɨa wan ki ka ke ri Futiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ri bubu wan ki ka fe wa hu Izhi ri bubu wan, waka ibreta ri ki kuru ti vi tangban ri wawa. ri ngamba kika ke ri Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Riwa imiri vayi won wa wo ri ki ye, waka zren ye ritu wa ri waye zhu ri richu Abiyas ri tre hari ri son vɨri. Riwa Bulus a towa ran kinklan sron. Riwa Bulus ka fe wa, ka ngɨri ri Izhi, ri bubu wan ka fe senkpa. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Riwa ki gra ri Roma waka nyɨme Bulus no ri ran gɨzhi ri bubu wan nga nji ri kilukpa riwa ari ya wu.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a la Tre Izhi Ri Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Riwa a ti vi tra ka yo wa rinkon wa nji Yahuda rimi gbu. Riwa wa ye kuki ka lawa ri: &lt;&lt;Biyi miri Vayi, me ran ti kyari meme ri nji mbu ran, ko ri bibi ti wati watimbu, waka vu wen ri Urushelima wa kawen no nji Romawa. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Riwa wa wa wen ri tre, wa ran wa wari ka wen chuwo, ritu mi ran ti kya riwa a ke riwa wa wuu wen ran. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ama nji Yahuda waka kamba ka he dole rimo me nowa ngɨzhi tre won hi kusi Kaisar, a ran ritu me ngɨzhi tre miri vayi won ri hi ran. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ikya riwa me wa me ri no yi to, ritu a he yo sron won ri Israila riwa ritu me he rimi che nyin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Waka la riwu ri, &lt;&lt;Kita ki ran fe mbe ri Yahudiya ran ritu wen, vayi njo ran ye ri nyɨn ran ngɨzhi tre wen ye ran, ko ran tre meme tre ritu wen ran. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ama ki wa kiri wo ri nyu wen ikya riwa a he ri sron wen, don idan a he ritu darika nyin nyen, ki to ri ko kutan wa tre ritu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Riwa wa yo vi riwu waka ye ri bubu riwa ari gɨzhi waka kigbu mba ka ran bla riwa, ran ran lawa tre kpanchison wan.Vu ri mibrei ri yawulu, ran wa ran kɨma wa tsro ritu Yeso, ri nkon doka Musa nga mbe Anabawa. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Wari wa kpa nyɨme ri tre wan wari wa ka kamba ri nyɨme tre wan. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Riwa wa kamba ri kpa nyɨme, rimi ŋba nga Bulus ka tre wa ri, Kpanji tre nyen iyu tsɨri tsɨri a tre riwa a tre ri wa timbi hu ŋju nji ri la tre Izhi Ishaya ri,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />&lt;Hi ri wamba, wu ri tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Bi wo ama bi ran vungɨzhi ran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">isi mba ri hɨma bi ran to tsu ran ya ama bi ran to ran,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ritu isiron nji wamba wa he meme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ari he riya no wa wo ri ton mba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">wa gyuru si mba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Bulus ka to ngamba, ikpachuwo-a he riwa Izhi, wa ngɨzhi wu ye ritu wawa wa ran to Izhi ran, nga wari siren ton!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Riwa Bulus a tre ngamba nji Yahuda waka ran janyu ri ngamba. <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Bulus ka son rimi ko haya, ran ti se hari, ran kpa wawa wa ye ri wu. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Ran la tre kpanchison , nga ran la tre bibi to Yeso Almasɨu a ran ti sisin ran, njo ka ran zu ran.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>